<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">Samuel Khatna</book>
  <para style="h">Samuel Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samuel Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samuel Khatna</para>
  <para style="mt">Samuel Khatna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim mualtung ngam Ramah khua ah Ephraim nam ahi Elkanah a kici pasal khat om hi. Ama sia Jeroham ii ta, Elihu ii tupa hi a, Tohu baangkua, Zuph bee le phung sung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elkanah in zi nii nei a, Hannah le Peninnah ahi hi. Peninnah in ta nei ahihang Hannah in nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum simin Elkanah sia Topa Vaanglianbelpa bia tu le sangaw biakpiakna vawt tu in Ramah pan Shiloh ah pai hi, tua munah Eli ii tapa nii te Hophni le Phinehas sia Topa ii thiampi seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elkanah in sangaw biakpiakna a vawt simin, tel khat Peninnah pia a, tel khat tek sia a tate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in Hannah it mama hi napi tel khat bek pia thei hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in ta neisak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kidem pui Peninnah in ama sia nunau zazaan in, a maizum thethei tu in vawt sia hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in Hannah sia ta selsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum khat zawk kum khat hi bangin papai a; Topa ii inn ah a pai uh simin Peninnah in Hannah a thin lalsak mama ahikom Hannah sia kap a, bangma a ne nuam bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pasal Elkanah in, “Hannah awng, banghangin kap ni ziam? Banghangin an ne nuam ngawl ni ziam? Banghangin hee tawntung ni ziam? Tapa sawm sangin kei sia nang atu manpha zaw hi ngawl khi ziam?” ci in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni khat, amate Shiloh khua, Topa inn sungah an a neak zawk uh ciang, Hannah hong dingto hi. Ama sia a thin na sa mama a, kap ngawpin Topa tungah thungen hi. Tua hun sung tengin Eli thiampipa sia ama omna kongkha hui ah to nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hannah in a ciliap huai kamciam khat pia hi: Vaanglianbelpa “ Topa awng, na naseamnu hong en ta'n! Ka ngimna hong en ta'n a, hong phawk ta'n! Hong mangil heak in! Tapa khat nong pia le, ama nuntakna buppi nang tungah tuam aap tu in kong kamciam hi, ama in a sam meet ngeingawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hannah in Topa tungah hun saupi sung thungen top a, tuaciang Eli in ama ii muk en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama sia a thimthamin thungen hi; a muk phun ahihang a aw suaksak ngawl hi. Tua ahikom Eli in ama sapittui kham hi tu in um hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciang ama munah, “Na zukham ngamtatna teng tawp in! Zu ne nawn heak in a, na zu neak tawp in!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Hi ngawl khi hi, kei zu kham hi ngawl khi hi, topa awng, zu ne sa in om ngawl khi hi! A cimaw ka hi hi, thu ngengen in ka ngimna teng Topa tungah sung khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nupi mannung ngawl hong sa heak in. Lungmang mama ka hikom hi bangin thu ngengen khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Thinnuam in va pai ta'n, Israel te ii Pathian in na nget teng hong pia tahen,” Eli in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“A tawntungin cikna thiamna taw kei hong phawk ta'n,” ama in ci hi. Tuasia zawkciang an tawm ne in paikhia a, a khuangai nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A zingsang kik ciang Elkanah le a innkuanpuite tho pal in, Topa a biak zawk uh ciang Ramah khua ah ciakik uh hi. Elkanah in a zi Hannah ompui a, Topa in a zi thungetna zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuabangin ama naungil om a, tapa khat hing hi. Ama in a min Samuel phuak a, “Ama sia Topa tung pan ka nget hi” a cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elkanah le a innkuanpuite Shiloh ah pai in Topa tungah kum sim sangaw biakpiakna le a kamciam tuam sangaw biakpiakna a piak tu hun hong cing kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang tusia hunin Hannah hong pai bua hi. Ama in a pasal munah, “Nau in noai a ten po ciang a nuntak sung teng a om natu in Topa inn ah ka paipui tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elkanah in zo kik a, “Pha hi, phabel na sak bangin vawt in; nau noai na tensak dong inn ah om in. Tuaciang Topa in na kamciam hong taangtungsak hen,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Hannah sia inn ah om a, a nau keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in nau noai a tensak zawkciang Shiloh ah paipui a, kum thum a pha khuital khat, anvui kilogramme 10 le savun ip sungah sapittui a dim keng hi. Ama in Samuel sia moi mama ahihang Topa inn Shiloh ah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in khuital a ngaw zawkciang nauno sia Eli kungah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hannah in ama munah, “Topa awng hong ngai zii ta'n. Kei nong ciamtee lai ziam? Kei sia hi munah dingin Topa tungah thu a ngengen nong mu numei sia khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi patang sia ama munah ka ngen a, ka nget bangin hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa tungah ama aaptuam khi hi. A nuntak lai theampo ama sia Topa neisa suak tu hi,” ci hi. Tua zawkciang amate in tua munah Topa bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hannah in hi bangin thungen hi: “ Topa in ka lungtang sia lungdamna taw hong dimh hi; Ama ii sepna sate hu in bangza in ka lungdam ziam! Ka ngalte ka nuisan hi; Pathian in hong hu ahikom bangza in ka thinnuam ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Topa bangin a thiangtho kuama om ngawl hi; Ama taw a kibang kuama om ngawl hi, Ih Pathian bangin hong dal kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kisuantaak vazakna uh teng kheal vun; Na kiphatsak kampaute thimsak vun. Banghang ziam cile Topa sia a he a tel Pathian hi a, mihingte sepna vawtna theampo tungah thu khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngalkap thahat te ii thalte taltan a, ahihang a thazawmte thahat tawto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khatvei lai in pha takin a kivaakte, tu in an thalaw bek a, ngual cial sa in om hi, ahihang a ngilkialte sia kial nawn ngawl hi. Tasel zi sia ta sali hong nei hi, ahihang ta tam mama te ii nu kungah kuama a taang nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in thatlum a, tuaciang nungtasak kik hi; ama in mihingte sia mithi khua ah puak hi, tuaciangin heakpui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in mihing pawlkhat zawngkhalsak a, pawlkhat hausak hi; pawlkhat sia ama in kiniamkhiaksak a, pawlkhat liansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in mizawngte leivui panin laamto a, a kitasamhte a lungmanna panin phongto hi. Amate sia kumpipa tapate taw kithawlsakin, ki upat vawtna munah koi hi. Simlei ii phungkawng sia Topa aa hi; tuate ii tungah ama in leitung sato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ama in a thumaan a mite ii nuntakna dal hi, ahihang a seksolte sia khuazing sungah mang hi; mihing khat in ama hantang tha ngum hatna taw mualsuak zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa ii ngalte sia kisusia cip tu hi; Topa in amate vantung panin vanto bangin langpan tu hi. Topa in leitung buppi thu hong khen tu hi; ama in a kumpipa tungah vaangletna pia tu hi, ama ii teal kumpipa in zosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Elkanah sia Ramah ah cia kik hi, ahihang Samuel patangno sia Shiloh ah taang a, thiampi Eli khutnuai ah Topa naseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eli ii tapate sia mihing phelphol vive hi. Amate in Topa a awlmaw bua uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua bek dom ngawlin thiampite ii mipite tung pan a nget thei tu te a nadon bua uh hi. Tua taangin mihing khat ii sangaw biakpiakna a om ciangin thiampi pa ii naseampa in kaa thum nei thiktung zum khat taw hong pai uh hi. A sa a kihuan saan laitakin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ama in beal sungah a thiktung kaa taw sun a, a laak po sia thiampipa ii neisa ahi hi. Shiloh ah sangaw biakpiakna pia tu in hong pai Israel mite theampo sia hi bangin kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua banah ngan thau hoai in a kihal ma in, thiampipa ii naseampa hong pai a, sangaw biakpiakna a pia pa munah, “Sa pawlkhat thiampipa em tu hong pia ta'n; ama in na sa huansa hong saang ngawl tu hi, sasial bek dei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua pa in, “A maan bangin ngamta tawng, a thau hal phot tawng; tua zawkciang na dei po la in,” ci in a zo ciang, “Hi ngawl hi! tu ma in hong pia ta'n! Nong pia buale zawthawk thu taw la tu khi hi!” thiampipa ii naseampa in ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi bangin Eli ii tapate mawna sia Topa muna ah nasia leih hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Topa tungah biakpiaknate tuabangin simmawk vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hun sungin patang Samuel sia puanneal kawngsawm thiangtho khat taw Topa na seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A nu in a pasal ii kum sim sangaw biakpiakna a vawt simin a pai khop uh ciangin, puantual khat veu ama atu in khuisak a, puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hun ciang Eli in Elkanah le a zi thupha pia a, Elkanah munah, “ Topa atu na piaktuam na tapa taangin hi numei nu tung panin ta dangte zongh hong pia tahen,” ci hi. Tua zawkciang amate inn ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in Hannah sia thupha pia takpi a, tapa thum le tanu nii nei thua hi. Patang Samuel sia Topa na a sepna sungah khangto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu in Eli sia huai mama zo hi. Ama in a tate ii Israel mite tungah a ngamtatna theampo zaza a, Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang a na a seam numeite ngawngawn luppui uh hi, ci in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate munah, “Banghangin hi bangte vawt nu ziam? Mihing theampo in siatna na vawt uhte hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kheal vun, ka tate awng! Hi thu sia a lipkhaphuai mama in Topa mite ii son ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihing khat in midang khat tungah a maw le Pathian in sungsia thei hi, ahihang Topa tungah a mawte sia akua in sungsia thei tu ziam?” ci hi. Ahihang amate in a pa thu a ni bua uh hi, tua ahikom Topa in amate thalup tu in khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Patang Samuel sia hong khang tawto a, Topa le mihingte mai ah maipha nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa kung pan hi thu puak in kamsaang khat Eli kungah hong pai hi: “Na taanghpupi Aaron le innkuanpuite Egypt kumpipa salin a om lai in, Aaron tungah keima ka kilaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel minam theampo ii sung pan keima thiampi tu, biaknatau ah a seam tu, ngimnamtui hal tu, ephod silh a, keima thu hong dongh tu in amate innkuan ka teal hi. Tuaciangin biaknatau tungah a kihal sangaw biakpiakna te tel khat sia amate tan thei natu thu ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua hikasap ka mite tung pan, ka nget biakpiaknate le sangaw biakpiaknate banghang duhopna thin taw en ni ziam? Eli awng, ka mite ii kei tungah hong piak sangaw biakpiakna theampo pan sabak phabel teng taw na tate a thau dong amate le amate na kivaaksakna taw banghangin kei sangin na tate upat vawt zaw ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keima, Israel te ii Topa Pathian in na innkuan le na phung sia keima thiampi seam tawntung tu hi, ci in a bosa hun sungah kamciam ka pia hi. Ahihang tu ahile kong cina pan, tuasia len nawn ngawl khi hi! Tua sangin kei hong patoai te ka patoai tu a, kei hong simmaw te ka ngaimawk vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai in, na bangkua sungah kuama a khanhaam in a nuntak ngawl natu, na bee na ngui sungah tangval khangmoi teng ka thalup siat tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangma in ngim na nga tu a, Israel midangte thupha ka piakte na eang tu hi, ahihang na bangkua sungah kuama a khanhaam dong a nungta buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahitazong na suan na paalte khat sia keamin ka nungtasak tu a, thiampi in ka na seam tu hi. Ahihang ama sia a mittaw in, a lam etna theampo bo tu hi, tuaciang na suan na paal theampo sia thi ngamh in thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na tapate nii Hophni le Phinehas, ni khat thu in hong thi khop ciang kong son teng tung hi ci in hong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vawt le ka oai theampo vawt a, kei tungah hong thumaan tu thiampi dang khat ka teal tu hi. Ama sia suan le paal ka pia tu a, amate in ka teal kumpipa omna ah seam tawntung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na suan na paal sung pan a luhai lai te in tua thiampipa kungah pai in sum le anneak tu ngen tu a, tuaciang a neak tawm tu a zonna in thiampite nasep a hu thei natu in ngen tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun lai, patang Samuel in Eli ii lamlakna bang a Topa atu a sep lai in, Topa tung pan thu hong pai sia tawm mama hi, tuaciang mang muna te tam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu in a mit a taw cip dektak Eli sia, zan khat, ama inndoi sungah mu in om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuel sia Thuciamna Thingkuang thiangtho omna biakpiakna munah mu in om hi. Khuavak ma, meiinn a taan laitak ma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Samuel sam hi. Ama in “Hi sungah om ing, topa!” ci in zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaciang Eli kungah tai a, “Kei nong sap sia, hi sung ma ah om khi hi,” ci hi. Ahihang Eli in zo a, “Nang hong sam ngawl khi hi; lum kik ta'n,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Samuel sia a lupna zuan kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Samuel sam kik hi. Patangpa in Topa ahi hunlam a he bua hi, banghang ziam cile tua masia in Topa in ama a paupui ngei bua hi. Tua ahikom ama tho in Eli kungah pai a, “Nong sap sia hi sungah om khi hi,” ci hi. Ahihang Eli in, “Ka tapa awng, hong sam ngawl khi hi; lum kik ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Samuel sia a thum veina sam hi; ama tho a, Eli kungah pai in, “Nong sap sia, hi sungah om khi hi,” ci hi. Tuasia ciang Eli in patang a sam sia Topa ahi hunlam phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua ahikom ama munah, “Lupna zuan kik ta'n; tuaciang ama in hong sam kik le hi bangin ci in, ‘ Topa awng pau in, na naseampa in hong ngai khi hi,’ ci ta'n,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Samuel sia lupna zuan kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa hong pai a tua munah dingin, a masa bangma in sam kik a, “Samuel! Samuel!” ci hi. Samuel in zo a, “Hong paupui ta'n; na naseampa in hong ngai khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in ama munah, “Ni khat ni ciang Israel mite tungah a lauhuai mama khat ka vawt tu a, a za peuma lau ngawp tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ni in Eli innkuante ka tawnna theampo a kipat pan a tawp dong ka tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama munah a bangkua sia a tawntung daan ka piak tu son zo khi hi, banghang ziam cile a tapate kei hong langpanin kamsia pau uh hi. Eli in hite sia he nginge ahihang tho ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Eli ii bangkua tungah sangaw biakpiakna ahizong, piakkhiatna ahizong bangma in, hi a lipkhaphuai mama mawna taw a kizui a piang tu te pengsak zo ngawl tu hi ci in ciliap huai takin ka taangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel sia zingsang dong lupna tungah om hi; tua zawkciang tho in, Topa inn kongkha hong hi. A mangmuna huvau Eli tungah a son tu sia lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eli in, “Samuel, ka patangpa awng!” ci in sam hi. “Om khi hi, topa” ci in Samuel in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eli in, “ Topa in bang hong son ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Kei tungah bangma hong iim heak in. Hong son theampo nong son buale Pathian in nasia takin daan hong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom Samuel in ama tungah na theampo son a, bangma kheet a nei bua hi. Eli in, “Ama sia Topa hi; phabel a sak bangin ama in seam tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel hong khan ciang Topa sia ama taw omkhawm a, Samuel ii son teng a vekpi in taangtungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom Israel mi theampo, a ngam mong pan a mong khat dongin, Samuel sia Topa kamsaang takpi hi ci in he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in ama le ama sia Shiloh ah a kizomin Samuel tungah hong kilaak a, paupui hi. Tuaciang Samuel ii a pau ciang, Israel theampo in ngai uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Philistine te in Israel sim tu in kikaikhawm ahikom Israel te sia amate do tu in kuan uh hi. Israel te in Ebenezer ah, Philistine te in Aphek ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistine te in simin, a nasia mama in a kido zawk uh ciang Israel te zo a, ngalphual ah mihing 4,000 bang that uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thimong teng ngiaphual hong thet kik uh ciangin Israel lampuite in, “Banghangin Topa in tuni in ei hong lelsak ziam? Topa ei taw tonkhawmin ih ngalte khut pan hong hut natu in Shiloh ah pai in Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang va la tawng,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in kamtaite Shiloh ah paisak a, tha nei cherubim te ii tungah kumpi in a maang Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia lasak hi. Tuaciang Eli ii tapate nii Hophni le Phinehas te Thuciamna Thingkuang taw hong ton uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang hong thet ciangin Israel te nasia takin lungdamna taw au ahi uh ciang, lei liing liang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Philistine te in a au uh za in, “Hebrew te ngiaphual ah a auna ngai vun! A khiakna bang ziam?” ci uh hi. Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia Hebrew ngiaphual ah a thet a heak uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />amate lau in, “Pathian khat amate ngiaphual theng hi! Eite mansa hi hing! Tu ma sia in hi bang peuma piang ngeingawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua a vaangnei pathiante tung pan ei akua in hong hun zo tu ziam? Tua pathiante sia sennealngam sungah Egypt te a monte ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hang vun, Philistine te awng! Pasal bangin do vun, tua ahibuale amate eima sila ahi bangma, amate ii sila ih suak tu hi. Tua ahikom pasal bangin do vun!” kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Philistine te in nasia takin do in, Israel te zo uh a, amate sia a inn zuanin tai uh hi. Nasia takin kithalupna om a: Israel ngalkapte 30,000 thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang matsak a, Eli tapate Hophni le Phinehas te ngeal thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin namte pasal khat ngalphual panin Shiloh ah tai vingveng a, hong ni tut hi. A khuangaina lianpi a lak natu in a puansilhte hong eaukeak a, a lu tungah leivui koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang atu a thinngim mama Eli sia lampi hui tokhum tungah to in mun khat salh nginge hi. Pasal pa in khuasung bup ah thu thangsak a, a kuama theampo in lau in au keak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eli in ngamlumna aw za in donghsak hi. “Hi ngamlumna aw sia bang thu ziam?” ci hi. Eli kungah a thuson tu in tua pa manlang takin hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />(Eli sia tu in kum 98 pha in a mittaw cip dek tak zo hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasal pa in, “Kei ngal kisimna pan suakta in, tuni in hisung dong lam tawntung kong tai hi,” ci hi. Eli in ama dongh a, “Bang thu piang ziam, ka tapa awng?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kamtai pa in, “Israel te sia Philistine te mai pan taikeak hi; ei atu a nasia mama lelna hi! Tua banah na tapate nii Hophni le Phinehas sia hong thalupsak hi, tuaciang Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang hong kimatsak hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasal pa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang thu a son ciang, kongpi hui a tona pan Eli thalpu hi. Ama huai mama a, thau si ahikom a puksukna in a ngawng tal a, thi hi. Ama sia Israel ah kum 40 lampui seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eli monu, Phinehas ii zi sia naungil om in nausua tu hun theng dektak hi. Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang kiman a, a topasal le a pasal thina thu a zaak ciang thakhat thu in a nau tun in ta nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama a thi nai tu ciang ama a hu numei sia in, “Na thinliansak in! Tapa khat nei ni hi!” ci hi. Ahihang ama in nangai ngawlin, a zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in a tapa min sia Ichabod phuak hi, a khiakna sia, “Pathian ii vaangletna in Israel nusia zo,” a cina hi, Thuciamna Thingkuang kimatna le a topasal le a pasal thina teng kilhtua in a phua khop ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in, “Pathian ii vaangletna in Israel nusia zo hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia hong kimatsak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistine te in Thuciamna Thingkuang a matsak zawkciang, Ebenezer panin amate khuapi Ashdod ah pua uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />amate ii Dagon pathian biakinn sungah tumpui in, a milim hui ah koi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zing ciang zingtuungin Ashdod mite ii milim sia Thuciamna Thingkuang mai lei ah lutu in a puk mu uh hi. Tua ahikom amate in phongto in a omna ngei ah koi kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zing kik ciang zingtuungin amate in a milim sia Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah a pukin mu kik uh hi. Tusia ciang a lu le a khutte nii taltan in kongbiang ah liik a; a pumpi bekma kinusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />(Tua hu in tuni dong ma Dagon thiampite le Ashdod a biakpiakna a vawt mite theampo in tua mun sia a pai ngei bangin pai ngawlin kan valian uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Ashdod mite sia nasia takin daan pia a, lausak ngawp hi. Amate le a kiim a paam a om mite sia Topa in daan pia a, meima pui veu veisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in tua thupiangte a mu uh ciang, “Israel ii Pathian in ei le ih Dagon pathian daan hong pia hi. Thuciamna Thingkuang sia hi lai ei kungah ki omsak thei nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom a kamtai te in Philistine kumpi nga teng samsak a, “Israel ii Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia bang law tu hi ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi. Amate in, “Tuasia Gath ah paipui tavun,” ci in zo uh hi; tua ahikom amate in Philistine khuapi dang khat ahi Gath ah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang tuasung a thet ciang Topa in tua khuapi zongh daan ma pia a, patauna nasia takin om hi. Khuapi sungah mihing theampo, a huai a khang a kibangin meima pui veisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in Thuciamna Thingkuang sia Ekron a kici Philistine te khuapi dang khat ah puak uh hi; ahihang tuasung a thet ciang, mihingte au keak in, “Israel te ii Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia amate in ei theampo hong thalup natu in hi sung hong then hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom Philistine kumpite theampo sam kikin, “Israel ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia, ei le ih innkuanpuite hong thalup ngawl natu in, a omna ngei ah puak kik tavun,” ci uh hi. Pathian in amate nasia takin daan pia ahikom khuapi sung bup ah patauna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thi ngawlte zongh meimapui vei ahikom mipite in amate ii pathiante munah hu ngenin au uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistia ngam ah Thuciamna Thingkuang tha sali a om zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mipite in thiampite le mitbum he te sam in, “ Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia bang law tu hi ziam? A omna ngei ah puak kik tu ih hile, bang taw tha tu hi ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in, “Israel te ii Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang na heak kiksak tu uh le na mawphel natu uh in ama atu letsong khat taw na kikopsak uh kul tu hi. Thuciamna Thingkuang sia letsong khat ngawl taw heak kik thei ngawl het tu hi. Tuabang taw in note na dam tu uh a, banghangin ama in no daan hong pia tawntung ziam ci sia na he tu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ama bang letsong pia tu hi ziam?” ci in mite in dongh uh hi. Amate in zo kik a, “Khamh taw a kivawt meimapui lim nga le Philistine kumpi khat sim atu khamh sanchiim lim nga hi tu hi. Ngimna lianpi sia a kibangin no theampo tung le kumpi nga teng tungah hong tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ngam buppi ah ngim hong pia meimapui le sanchiim lim te vawt hamtang in Israel te ii Pathian sia upat vawt nanak tu nu hi. Tua hile ama in noma, na pathian te le na ngam daan hong piakna tawp tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa le Egypt mite bangin banghangin na thinpuisak tu nu ziam? Israel mite ii Egypt a nusiat mateng Pathian in Egypt te a mawmaw bangin a vawt sia ciamtee vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom leang thak khat vawt vun a, kanhak a kibul ngeingawl khuipui nii la in, leang ah thua vun, a khuinote sia khuibuk sungah beng kik vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang la in, leang tungah suan vun, tuaciang na mawna phelna in letsong na piak tu uh, khamh lim note sia thingkuang dang khat sungah heangin tuasia kungah koi vun. Khuileang a pai natu lampi ah ama thuthu in a pai natu in kipansak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a paina en vun; Beth Shemesh sang a zuan le Israel te ii Pathian in hi a kiitakhuai tuasiatna hong puak hi, a cina hi. Tuabang a zuan buale, ngimnate sia ama ii hong puak hi ngawl a; a luilamna in a piang hi bek hi, ci in ih he tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a kisawl bangin ngamta uh hi: amate in khuipui nii la in leang ah thua uh a, khuinote sia khuibuk sungah khumcip uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in Thuciamna Thingkuang sia meimapui le sanchiim limte a kikoina thingkuang taw leang tungah koi khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuikaap in Beth Shemesh paina sang zuan tu in kipan in, tua khua sangah tangtan in pai a, lam a pial bua hi. Tuate sia a pai kawmin haam uh hi. Philistine kumpi nga teng in Beth Shemesh ngamngi dong zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Beth Shemesh khua mite, kuam sungah zungtaang at in a om laitak, thakhat thu in a etto uh le Thuciamna Thingkuang mu uh hi. Amate in a mu ciangin lungdam leilam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beth Shemesh khua ah a teang Joshua a kici pasal khat ii lo sungah a leang pai a, suangpi khat ii hui ah tawlnga hi. Mite in leang sia sem tham a, khuipuite ngoin, Topa tungah meihal sangaw biakpiakna in nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi te in Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang le khamh limnote a kikoi thingkuang sia laamto in, suangpi lian sia tungah koi uh hi. Tua zawkciang Beth Shemesh khua mite in meihal sangaw biakpiakna le a dang sangaw biakpiakna te Topa tungah vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Philistine kumpi nga teng in hisia en uh a, tua zawkciang tua ni ma in Ekron ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Philistine mite in a khuapi ngate Ashdod, Gaza, Ashkelon, Gath, le Ekron te atu in khua khat ah khat tek a khamh meima pui nga sia Topa tungah mawphel natu in pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Philistine kumpi ngate ii uk ahi a ki uum khuate hikale, a ki uum ngawl khuanote hikale khuapi sim atu in khamh sanchiim lim khat tek zongh pia si hi. Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang koina Beth Shemesh khua mi Joshua lo sungah a om tua suangpi sia tualai ah a piang thu te ii tetti in tuni dongin om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang sungsang a et hu in Beth Shemesh khua mite 70 Topa in thatlum hi. Tuaciang Topa in tuabangin nasia tak thalupna a thuaksak hu in mipite khuangai in tau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom Beth Shemesh mite in, “Hi a thiangtho Pathian, Topa mai ah akua peuma dingtang zo tu hi ziam? Ei taw a kikhuala thei natu in ama koisungah puak tu hi ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in kamtaite paisak a, Kiriath Jearim mite munah, “Philistine te in Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang hong heaksak kik zo hi. Hong paisuk tavun a, tua vun,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahikom Kiriath Jearim mite in Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang sia la in, mualtung a teang Abinadab a kici pasal khat ii inn ah tun uh hi. Amate in a tapa Eleazar sia a keam tu in thiansua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia Kiriath Jearim ah khuangeipi om a, kum kul bang om hi. Hisia hun sung tawntung Israel te theampo in Topa tungah hu ngen in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuel in Israel mite munah, “Na thinsung theampo taw Topa sangah na kihei tu uh le, ngamdang pathiante le Astarte numeipathian ii limte na vawk siat uh kul tu hi. Topa tungah noma le noma kipum aapna nei vun a, ama bek bia vun, tuaciang ama in Philistine te khut sung pan hong suatak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom Israel mite in Baal le Astarte ii milim theampo vawkin Topa bek bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Samuel in Israel te theampo Mizpah ah kisitua tu in sam a, hi bangin ci hi, “Tua munah no atu in Topa tungah thu ka ngen tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate theampo Mizpah ah kikhawm uh hi. Amate in tui tawm toai a, Topa biakpiakna in tua tui sung in, tua ni bup an tang uh hi. Amate in, “ Topa tungah maw zo khu hi,” ci uh hi. (Israel mite sungah kamtam kinialnate Samuel ii a khensakna mun sia Mizpah ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel te Mizpah ah kikhawm zo hi ci in Philistine te in a zaak ciang a kumpipa nga teng in a mite taw amate sim tu in kuan uh hi. Israel te in tua thu za in lau uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuaciang Samuel munah, “Philistine te kung pan hong hut natu Topa ih Pathian tungah thu ngen tawntung in,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samuel in tuuno khat ngoin, a bupin hal a, Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna nei hi. Tua zawkciang ama in Topa ii Israel te a hu natu thungen a, tuaciang Topa in a thungetna zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuel in sangaw biakpiakna a vawt laitakin, Philistine te in a sim tu in mai hong kaa uh hi; ahizong tuasia po ciang Topa in vantung panin amate tungah vanto keaksak hi. Amate sia a lungmang cip a, patau in tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel te kuan in Mizpah pan Bethcar a thet dektak dong, Philistine te zuizen a, lampi ah thathat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Samuel in suangtum khat la in Mizpah le Shen kilaklaw ah phut in, “ Topa in lam tawntung hong hu hi” ci in a min sia “Huna Suangpi” (Ebenezer ) vaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuabangin Philistine te in lel a, Samuel nuntak lai teng Israel ngam a sim tu Topa in khaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ekron le Gath kilak law Philistine te ii a laak khuapi teng Israel te kipia kik ahiciang Israel te in a ngam theampo nga kik hi. Tuaciang Israel te le Canaan mite sung zongh ah ngal kilemna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel in a nuntak lai teng Israel te uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kum simin ama in Bethel, Gilgal, le Mizpah ah paikot in hi munte ah kamtam kinialnate thu khensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama sia Ramah ah cia kik in, tua munah thukhenmang seam hi. Ramah ah Topa atu biaknatau khat saa hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel a huai ciangin, a tapate Israel thukhenmang seamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A u min sia Joel hi a, a nau zaw sia Abijah hi; amate sia Beersheba ah thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang amate in a pa nasep bangin a seam bua uh hi; amate in sum vawt tu bek kin ahikom, sumnguk ne in thumaan thutang taw thu a khen bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Israel lampui theampo kikhawmtua in, Ramah ah a om Samuel kungah pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“En in, nang sia haam vaial zo a, tuaciang na tate sia nang sul hong zui ngawl hi. Tuabang ahikom ngamdangte ii nei bangin, ko hong uk tu kumpipa khat hong tealsak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Samuel sia amate ii kumpipa khat a ngetna huvau lungkim ngawl hi; tua ahikom ama in Topa tungah thungen hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaciang Topa in, “Mipite ii nang tungah hong son theampo ngai in. Amate ii nial sia nang hi ngawl ni hi; keima sia a kumpipa ka hina hong nial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt panin amate ka pusua pui pan kipan, amate in kei hong nusia in pathian dangte bia uh hi; kei tungah hong vawt tawntung teng tu in nang tungah hong vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuabang ahikom, amate thu ngai in a, ahizong a kumpipate in amate bangbangin vawt tu ziam ci sia a kidop khol natu a pha tatakin son in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuel in kumpipa khat a ngen mipite tungah, Topa ii ama tungah a ci teng son siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samuel in, “Hisia in na kumpipa ii no hong vawt tu dan ahi hi. Ama in na tapate ngalkap suaksak tu hi; pawlkhat sia a siphu ngalleang te uksak tu hi, a dangte sia siphu ngalkap suaksak tu a, tuaciang pawlkhat sia siphu ngalleangte ii mai ah taisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in pawlkhat te sia mihing tulkhat ukin koi tu a, pawlkhat sia mihing sawmnga uk in koi tu hi. Na tapate in ama lote a thawsak uh kul tu a, a an laaksakin, a ngalhiamte le siphu ngalleang sungah a kizangh vanhte vawtsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tanute sia ama ii sathau namtui vawtsak in, a anhuan, a moh emte hisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in noma lo phabel te, sapithuante le olive kungte la in a uliante pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Noma lo an sawm a khat le na sapit uh sawm a khat la in, a kumpi inn sung uliante le zum naseam dangte hawmsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in na naseamte, na khui phabelte le laate la tu a, na seamsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tuu honte sung pan sawm a khat ama in la tu hi. Tuaciang noma mama zongh ama ii silate na suak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hun hong thet ciang, noma ii tealsa na kumpipa hangin nasia takin na phun na mau tu uh hi, ahihang Topa in na phun na mauna uhte hong ngai ngawl tu hi,” ci in sonthiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mipite in Samuel nadon ngawlin, “Phamaw bo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngamdangte taw ka kiban natu in ko zongh kumpipa khat dei khu hi, ko hong uk tu le ngalmai si in a do tu kumpi tuam dei khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Samuel in amate ii son theampo ngai a, tua zawkciang pai a, Topa tungah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in, “Amate dei bangin vawt in a, kumpipa khat amate pia ta'n,” ci in zo hi. Tua zawkciang Samuel in Israel mite theampo a inn uh ah cia kikin sawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin nam pan Kish a kici mihau, mihing thupi khat om hi; ama sia Abiel ta, Zeror ii tu, Becorath bangkua sung pan hi a, Aphiah ii phung sung mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Saul a kici tapa, a mealpha khang tungto khat nei hi. Saul sia Israel sungah ngual dang theampo sangin lu tun khat bang saang zaw a, a meal zongh phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kish ii laate pawlkhat vakthap a, tua ahikom ama in Saul munah, “Naseamte khat taw ih laa va zong ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Ephraim mualtung ngam teng le Shalishah ngamkhawk sung teng zong uh a, a zon uh hang a mu bua uh hi; tua ahikom amate in Shalishah ngam khawk kaantan in pai lai ahihang a laa om ngawl hi; tuasia ciang Benjamin ngam zongh kaantan ahihang a mu peang bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuph ngamkhawk sung a thet uh ciangin, Saul in a naseampa munah, “Cia tawng, tua ahibuale ka pa sia laate huvau ngaisun nawn ngawlin eima atu thinngim tha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A naseampa in, “Na om zii in! Hi khuapi sungah mi thiangtho khat om a, ngual in nasia takin thasia hi, banghang ziam cile ama ci theampo taangtung hi. Ama kungah pai tawng, ama in laate koisungah kimu thei tu ci in hong son thei tha tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul in, “Ama kungah pai leang ama bang pia thei natu hi ziam?” ci hi. “Ih ip sungah an om nawn ngawl a, ama ih piak tu bangma om ngawl, hi ngawl ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A naseampa in zo a, “Ngunn tang no khat nei khi hi, tuasia ama pia thei khi hi, tua hile a omna mun hong son tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul in zo kik a, “Na ngaisutna pha hi! Pai tawng,” ci hi. Tua ahikom amate mi thiangtho pa ii teenna khua sungah pai uh hi. Amate khua suana mual ah a kaa tawto laitakin, tuitoai tu ngaknu pawlkhat taw kisi uh hi. Ngaknute munah, “A mukhol theipa khua sungah a om ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi. (Tua hun lai in kamsaangte sia a mukhol thei pa kici a, khat po in Pathian munah thu a dok nop ciang, “A mukhol thei pa kungah pai tawng,” ci uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngaknute in, “Om hi, ama sia noma mai hiat ma ah pai hi. Manlang le uhte pha lai tu nu hi. Khua sung na tum uh po ciang ama mu tu nu hi. Ama sia khua sungah tuni in hong theng hi, banghang ziam cile mipite in mualtung biaknatau ah sangaw biakpiakna nei nuam hi. Tua munah a kisam mite sia ama thet mateng an ne ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama in tua biakpiakna sia thupha a piak phot kul hi. Tu laitakin pai le uhte mual tungah an ne tu in a kaato ma in kimu thei tu nu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul le a naseampa khuapi sangah paitan a, a sung a tum uh ciang biakna munah zuan a, hong papai Samuel mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in a zeini tu sia hunin Samuel tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Zing ciang tubang hunin Benjamin nam mihing khat na kungah hong puak tu khi hi, ka mi Israel te a ukpa tu in sathau na noai in, tuaciang ama in amate sia Philistine te khut sung pan suatak tu hi. Ka mite thuakna ka mu zo a, hu ngenin a auna ka za zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel in Saul a mu ciang, Topa in ama munah, “Hisia pa sia kong sonsa sia hi. Ama in ka mite uk tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Saul sia kongkha hui ah a om Samuel kungah pai in, “A mukhol thei pa koi sungah teang ziam, hong son ta'n,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel in, “Keima a mukhol theipa khi hi. Biakna mun ka mai ah pai vun. No nii sia tuni in kei taw an nekhawm tu nu hi. Zing ciang zingsang in nong dok teng theampo hong son tu khi hi, tua zawkciang na pai natu po ah hong paisak tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu nung ni thum lai in a bo laate ahile thinngim heak in; tuate kimu zo hi. Ahizong, Israel mite ii a dei a lungngul mama sia akua ziam? Nangma ni hi — nang le na pa ii innkuan ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in zo a, “Kei sia Israel sungah nam nobel Benjamin nam pan khi hi, tuaciang ka bangkua sia tua nam sung pan a thupi ngawlbel hi. Tua ahiciang banghangin tubangin thu hong son ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Samuel in Saul le a naseampa inndoi lian khat sungah tumpui a, leangna 30 khawng ii tona sabuai lu ah tosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Samuel in an huan pa munah, sabak khat tuamkoi in ci a kong piak sia hong la ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahikom anhuanpa in a deiteal a pheisa bak khat hong la in, Saul mai ah hong lui hi. Samuel in, “En in, hi sungah sabak nang atu a kikoituam sia om hi. Hisia ne in. Mihing ka samte taw tu laitak na neak tu in kong khealsiasak hi,” ci hi. Tuabangin tua ni in Saul sia Samuel taw an nekhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biakna mun panin khua sungah a tuaksuk zawk uh ciang, amate in innkhum tungah Saul atu lupna vawtsak uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuaciang ama tua munah lum hi. Khuavak ciang Samuel in innkhum tungah Saul sam to a, “Tho in, na pai natu munah hong paisak tu khi hi,” ci hi. Saul tho in Samuel taw lampi zui in paikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khua mong a thet uh ciang, Samuel in Saul munah, “Naseampa ei mai ah paisak in,” ci hi. Naseampa in amate nusia a, Samuel in, “Tawmvei no sung hi sungah na om zii in, Pathian ii hong cina teng hong son tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Samuel in olive thau thawl khat la a, Saul lu tungah buakin ama a nap zawkciang, “ Topa in a Israel mite uk tu in nang sathau hong noai hi. Ama mite nangma uk in, a ngalte theampo kung panin amate na hung tu hi. Tuaciang Topa ii a mite a uk tu nang hong teal takpina sia hi bangin kilak tu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuni kei nong nusiat ciang Benjamin ngam Zelzah khua Rachel ii thaan ah mihing nii taw na kisi tu hi. Amate in laa na zonte kimu kik zo a, na pa sia tuate atu thinngim nawn ngawl hi, nangma atu thinngim a, hi bangin dok sasaan hi, “Ka tapa vai bang law tu khi ziam?” hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tabor ah biakna thingkung omna san na thet dong na papai tu a, tua munah mihing thum, Bethel ah Pathian tung sangaw biakpiakna pia tu in a paite taw na kisi tu hi. Tuate khat in kealngual thum kai tu a, a dang khat in anluum luum thum, a thumna sia in savun thawl a dim sapittui pua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in nang hong muak in, anluum luum nii hong pia tu a, tuate na saang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, Philistine te ngiaphual saatna khat a omna, Gibeah ngamsung Pathian Mual ah na pai tu hi. Khua sung tumna ah kamsaang pawlkhat, mualtung biaknatau pan tengtongh, khuang, tamngai le liamlo te tumin hong tuaksuk te taw na kisi tu uh hi. Amate laam in a au tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Topa thaa in nang hong uk in, amate biakna taw kisai a lapna le a auna te na pawm tu a, mihing tuamdang khat na suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hite hong pian ciangin Pathian ii na vawt tu a hong lampui pawpo sia vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima mai Gilgal ah na paikhol tu a, tua munah ih kimu tu hi, tuaciang meihal sangaw biakpiaknate le pawlkhop sangaw biakpiaknate ka pia tu hi. Keima hong pai in, na sep na vawt tu teng kong son dong ni sali hong ngak tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samuel nusia tu in Saul a kiheak ciang, Pathian in Saul sia pianzia thak khat pia hi. Tuaciang Samuel son theampo tua ni in piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul le a naseampa Gibeah hong thet uh ciang, kamsaang pawlkhat taw kisi hi. Thakhat thu in Pathian thaa in ama uk a, tua ciang amate ii lawp ngawpin a ngualnop lapna le a auna pawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nidang in ama a he ngeite in hi bangin a om a mu uh ciang amate khat le khat kidongh a, “Kish ii tapa bang tawk ziam? Saul sia kamsaang khat suak zo ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua munah a teang pasal khat in, “Hi kamsaang dangte thu bangbangziam? — a pate sia akua bangte hi tu na um uh ziam?” Hisia sia, “Saul ngawngawn kamsaang khat suak zo ziam?” ci paunak ii kipatna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul zongh lawp ngawpin a lap le a au teng a man zawkciang mualtung biaknatau ah paito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul ii pano in ama le a naseampa mu a, “Koisung theng man nu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Laa zong khu hi,” ci in Saul in zo hi. “Ka mu zawk ngawl uh ciang Samuel taw kimu tu in pai khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuaciang ama in bang hong ci ziam?” ci in Saul pano in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul in, “Ama in ngannote kimu zo hi ci in hong son hi,” ci in zo hi — ahihang ama ii kumpipa a suana tu huvau Samuel ii ci teng a pano tungah a son bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel in Mizpah ah mipite biakkikhop khat sam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuaciang amate tungah, “ Topa Israel te ii Pathian in, ‘Egypt ngam panin kong pusua pui a, Egypt te le no hong nengniam midang te kung panin kong suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima sia na Pathian ka hi a, noma ngimna theampo le haksatna theampo panin hong suatak pa khi hi, ahihang tuni in hong nial in, kumpipa khat piak tu in nong ngen uh hi. Pha mama hi, tua ahile, Topa mai ah a nam le a bee a phung zui in hong kikhawm tavun,’ ” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Samuel in a nam simin mai ah paisak a, Topa in Benjamin nam tangkal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang Samuel in Benjamin namte sung pan a innkuan tek sia mai ah a paisak ciang Matri ii innkuan kiteal hi. Matri ii innkuan pan pasalte a mai ah hong pai a, tuaciang Kish ii tapa Saul kiteal hi. Amate in ama zongin a mu zawk ngawl ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />amate in Topa dongh a, “A dang khat ma a om lai ziam?” ci uh hi. Topa in zo a, “Saul sia zia sungah om hi, vanh honte nungah buu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate va tai in Saul sia mipite kungah hong paipui uh hi, tuaciang ama sia midang khat pawpo sangin lu tun khat saangzaw in mu thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Samuel in mipite munah, “Hi munah Topa ii teal sia pa om hi! Ei sungah ama taw a kibang kuama dang om ngawl hi,” ci hi. Mipite au siat in, “Kumpipa a khansau tahen!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Samuel in kumpipa khat ii sep thei te le a vaipuakte mipite tungah sonthiangin, laibu sungah a at zawkciang a thiangtho mun khat ah koi hi. Tua zawkciang ama in a kuama theampo inn tek ah ciasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul zongh Gibeah a inn ah cia hi. Pathian ii a lungtang a thuthaak pasal thahat pawlkhat in ama tonpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang mihing mannung ngawl pawlkhat in, “Hi sia pa in ei tungah a pha khat po bangbangin hong vawt thei thong tu ziam?” ci uh hi. Saul sia simmaw in letsong bangma a puak bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tha khat bang zawkciang Ammon kumpipa Nahash in Gilead ngam sung, Jabesh khua sia a ngalkaphonpi kuanpui in uumci hi. Jabesh mite in Nahash munah, “Ko taw thukimna kho khat vawt in, tuaciang hong ukpa tu in kong saang tu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nahash ii zo kikna pan, “Thu khat na lungkim uh le no taw thukimna kho khat vawt ma tawng: Israel mi bup mindai natu in khat sim ii mittang ziatsang khelsak tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jabesh lampuite in, “Israel ngam bup ah kamtaite ka paisak natu in ni sali hun hong pia ta'n. Kuama in hong hu tuak buale kong tum tu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamtaite Saul ii teenna Gibeah hong thengin, a thu teng a kison ciang mihingte sia thinkiamin kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul sia a khuitalte taw lo panin hong cia zawk hiat bek hi a, “Bang tat nu ziam? Banghang mihing theampo kap ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Amate in Jabesh pan kamtaite ii thupuak teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in hi thu a zaak ciang, Pathian thaa in ama uk a, a thinso hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in khuital nii ngoin, a bak a bak in a sem zawkciang, Israel ngam bup ah kamtaite sabak kengin paisak a, a kidop natu thu puaksak hi: “Ngal kisimna sungah Saul le Samuel nung a zui ngawl peuma a khuital tek uh tuabang ma in kivawtsak tu hi,” ci hi. Israel mite sia Topa in bang khat po a law thak tu lau in, khat zongh kikhe ngawlin hong paikhawm tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul in amate Bezak ah khawmtua a: Israel pan 300,000 le Judah pan 30,000 pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Jabesh pan kamtai te munah, “Na mipuite munah son vun, zing ciang nisun ma in amate kisuatak tu hi.” Jabesh a mite in tua thupuak a nga ciangin lungdam leilam uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciang Nahash munah, “Zing ciangin hong tum tu khu hi, nong law nop po hong law ta'n,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zanin Saul in a mite pawl thum in khen a, khuavak ciang ngalte ngiaphual sungah tum ngawpin Ammon te sim uh hi. Ni sun hun in amate thatlum ngawp uh hi. A suakta sun te khakhat in tai thaap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Israel mite in Samuel munah, “Saul sia ih kumpi seamsak ngawl tu hi a ci te koi sungah om siat ziam? Ko tungah hong aap tavun, thatlum siat tu khu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang Saul in, “Tuni in kuama kithisak ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in Israel a suatak ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Samuel in amate munah, “Ih vekpi Gilgal ah pai in, Saul sia ih kumpipa hi ci in khatvei taangko lai tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate Gilgal ah pai siat a, tuasung mun thiangthona ah Saul sia kumpipa hi ci in thangsak uh hi. Amate in pawlkhop sangaw biakpiaknate pia in, Saul le Israel mite theampo tua thu huvau in poai khaam uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Samuel in Israel mite munah, “Nong nget uh theampo hong vawtsak zo khi hi. Kumpipa khat no hong uk tu in hong pia zo khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tu in no lam hong pui tu ama nei zo nu hi. Kei ka hi le huai in ka puakkaang zo hi, tuaciang ka tate sia no taw omkhawm nu hi. Ka khangno lai pan kipan tu dong noma lampui seam zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi sungah om khi hi. Ka sep ka vawt khat po ahi ngawl a om le tu in Topa le a tealsa kumpipa mai ah maw hong suan tavun. Mihing khat po ii khui ahizong, laa ahizong kong laaksak ngei ziam? Akua khat po kong theam ngei, kong nengniam ngei ziam? Khat po tung pan sumnguk kong saang ngei ziam? Hi bang khat pawpo ka ngamta ngei le ka laak babang pia kik tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipite in zo a, “Hong theamin hong nengniam ngeingawl ni hi; kuama tung pan bangma la ngeingawl ni hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samuel ii a zo kikna pan, “Kei a maw ngawl het in nong mu uh sia Topa le ama ii tealsa kumpipa sia tuni in tetti ahi hi,” ci hi. “Hi ma hi, Topa sia kote ii tetti hi,” amate in ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Samuel in zom suak a, “ Topa sia Moses le Aaron a teal, Egypt pan na taanghpupite hong pusuapui sia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu in na omna tek ah ding vun, Topa ii noma le na taanghpupite a hut natu a nasep lianpite theampo no kong phawksak tu a, Topa mai ah note maw kong suan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jacob le a innkuanpuite Egypt ah a pai lai in, Egypt te in nengniam ahiciang, na taanghpupite in Topa munah hu ngenin au uh hi, tuaciang ama in Moses le Aaron paisak in, Egypt ngam pan amate pusua pui a, hi ngam ah teangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang mite in Topa a Pathian mangil a, tuasia ciang ama in Philistine te, Moab kumpipa le Hazor khuapi ii ngalkaphonpi ukpa Sisera te in na taanghpupite simsak a, zothal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in Topa tungah hu ngenin, ‘Ko sia maw zo khu hi, banghang ziam cile nang kung panin kiheak khu hi, Topa awng, tuaciang Baal le Astarte milimte bia khu hi. Ka ngalte kung pan hong suatak ta'n, tuaciang nangma hong bia tu khu hi!’ ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang, Topa in Gideon, Barak, Jephthah, a khakbel in kei hong paisak hi. Kote khat simin na ngalte khut sung pan no kong suatak uh hi, tuaciangin ngammuang takin na teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang Ammon te kumpipa Nahash in no hong sim tu in a kithoai laitak, Topa sia na kumpipa a hina na nial uh hi, tuaciang kei munah, ‘Ko hong uk tu kumpipa khat dei khu hi,’ nong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tu in hi sungah noma teal kumpipa om hi; na nget uh sia ama hi a, tuaciang Topa in no hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa na Pathian zatak vawtin a na seam in, tuaciang a thu ni in, a thupiakte na ni uh a, noma le na kumpipa in ama nung na zui uh le na theampo a dik a pha in hong piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Topa ii pau ngai ngawlin, a thupiakte na ni bua uh le ama in no le na kumpipa hong langpan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom na dinmun uh kholet vun, tua hile Topa hong sep tu na lianpite na mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu hun sia khuakhaal laitak hi kana ngawl ziam? Ahihang thu kong ngen tu a, Topa in vanto sakin nguatui hong puak tu hi. Hi bangin hong pian ciang kumpipa khat na nget uh sia Topa tungah nasia takin maw na hi uh hunlam na kiphawk tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom Samuel in thungen a, tua ni ma in Topa in vanto sakin nguazusak hi. Tuasia ciang mi theampo in Topa le Samuel kiita uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang Samuel munah, “Topa awng, nong hesuakna in, ka thi ngawl natu Topa na Pathian tungah thu hong ngetsak ta'n. Tu in koma mawna dangte tungsia ah kumpipa khat ka ngetna ah maw zo ka hi uh hunlam ka phawk uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samuel in, “Lau heak vun, siatna khaatna tuaza in vawt na hi uh hangin, Topa nusia heak vun, ahihang na thin theampo taw ama na na seam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A maan ngawl pathian te zuan heak vun; amate in hong hu thei ngawl, hong ngum thei ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile amate sia a tatak hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in a ciliap huai kamciamna vawt zo a, ama in no hong nusia ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile no sia ama mite hong hisak tu in khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei ka hile note atu thunget nawn ngawlna taw ama tungah mawna ka vawt ngawl natu Topa in thu hong pia hi. No vawt tu a pha le a maan thute kong hil zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa thu ni vun a, thumaan takin na thin theampo taw ama ii na seam vun. Na lianpi no atu hong sepsak te ciamtee vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang mawna na vawvawt lai uh le no le na kumpipa uh hong kisusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul in pasal tulthum teal a, ama in tulnii sia Michmash le Bethel mualtung ngam ah ama taw a om tu in koi a, tulkhat sia a tapa Jonathan taw Benjamin namte ii ngam Gibeah ah puak hi. Tua ngawl teng Saul in a inn tek ah ciasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonathan in Philistine ngalkap ukpa sia Geba ah that hi, tuaciang Philistine mi theampo in tua thu za uh hi. Tuasia ciang Saul in kamtaite paisak a, ngam bup sungah Hebrew mite ngal sim tu a samna in lemle tumsak kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul in Philistine ngalkap ukpa a thalupna thu, Israel mite theampo kizasak a, tuaciang Philistine te in amate ensan hi; tua ahikom mite in Gilgal ah Saul koppui tu in a sap bangin pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Philistine te sia Israel te sim tu in kikhawmtua uh hi; amate in siphu ngalleang 30,000, siphu ngalkap 6,000 nei a, ngalkapte sia tuipivaal a sen za in tam hi. Amate Bethaven nisuana sang Michmash ah kuanin, tuasung ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in Israel te nasia takin sim a, Israel te a cimaw dinmun ah koi hi. Israel mi pawlkhatte sia suanghawng, leihawng le suangpi kawm ahibuale leidum le tuikhuk sungah buu uh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a dangte Jordan ngun kan in, Gad le Gilead te ngamsung zuan uh hi. Saul sia Gilgal ma ah om lai a, ama taw a om mite lau in liing uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in ni sali sung Samuel ii sawl bangin Samuel ngak hi. Ahihang Samuel sia Gilgal ah hong pai peang bua hi. Mipite in Saul taisan tu kipan uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua ahikom ama in amate munah, “Meihal biakpiakna le pawlkhop sangaw biakpiakna ka kungah hong paipui tavun,” ci hi. Ama in meihal sangaw biakpiakna khat vawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a man lian laitakin Samuel hong theng hi. Saul in pai in muak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ahizong Samuel in, “Bang vawt thong ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Saul in zo a, “Mipite in hong taisan a, kong pai tu na ci bangin hong pai ngawl ni hi; tua banah Philistine te sia Michmash ah kikhawmtua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom, ‘Philistine te in hi sung Gilgal ah kei hong sim tu in om a, tuaciangin Topa maipha ka nga natu sep ka nei bua hi. Tua ahikom sangaw biakpiakna khat ka piak kul vak,’ ci in ka ngaisun hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuasia mawmawt nasep hi,” ci in Samuel in zo hi. “Nang in na Topa Pathian ii thupiak bangin ngamta ngawl ni hi. A thu ni hi lete nang le na suan na paalte in a tawntungin Israel hong uksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong na ukna sia kizom suak ngawl tu hi. Nangma in a thu ni ngawl na hikom ama ii dei bang mihing zong tu a, a mite uk tu in vawt tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel in Gilgal nusia a, ama pai natu ah pai hi. A dangte in Saul sia a ngalkapte kungah a pai ciang zui uh hi. Amate sia Gilgal pan Benjamin te ngamsung Gibeah ah pai uh hi. Saul in a ngalkap 600 khawng teng sit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul, a tapa Jonathan le a mite sia Benjamin te ngam Geba ah ngiaphual saat uh hi; Philistine te ngiaphual sia Michmash ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Philistine te in pawl thum kisua in a ngiaphual tek pan veu in sim uh hi: pawlkhen khat in Shual te ngamkhen Ophrah ah pai uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a dang pawlkhat in Beth Horon zuanin, tuaciang a dangkhat te in Zeboim Kuam le duisung a kingalmu theina ngamngi ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel te sungah thikseak kuama a om bua hi, banghang ziam cile Hebrew te ii namsau le tei a nei ngawl natu in Philistine te in nasia takin khak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />(Israel te in a hei, a tu, a phiau uh a hiamsak nop ciangin Philistine te kung veu ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hiamsak man sia hei le ngan hawlna ciang dawn ah a kisuan thik ahile ngunn dangkatang khat, lo thawna le tumanh ahile ngunntang tang nii piasak uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom ngal kido ni in Saul le a tapa Jonathan simngawl ngalkap dangte in namsau le tei a nei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Philistine te in ngalkap pawlkhat Michmash mualciangh cing tu in paisak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Jonathan in ngalhiamte a pua pa munah, “Philistine te ngiaphual kaantan in pai tawng,” ci hi. Ahihang Jonathan in a pa Saul munah a son bua hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a pa sia Gibeah pan a khuala ngawl Migron khua, talee kung nuai khat ah ngiaphual saat hi; ama in a kithuapui mihing 600 bang nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Ephod a silh thiampi sia Ichabod ii suapuipa Ahitub ii tapa Ahijah hi a, tua pa sia Phinehas ii tapa, Eli ii tupa hi a, Shiloh ah Topa ii thiampi ahi hi.) Jonathan ii paisat hunlam sia a mite in he ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistine te ngiaphual a thet thei natu in a kaantan tu a kul Michmash mualciangh ah suangpi dok nii a lang le a lang ah om a: tuate khat sia Bozez kici a, a dang khat sia Seneh kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khat zaw sia Michmash maingat a, mualciangh saksang ah om in, a khat sia a thang sangah Geba sang nga in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jonathan in tangvalpa munah, “Pathian he ngawl Philistine te ngiaphual kaantan tawng. Topa in hong hu thei tu hi; hong hu a ahile bangza in ih tawmbel hang, zawna hong piak natu sia bangma in khak ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tangvalpa in, “Na vawt nop babang hi hen, kei sia nangma taw pang khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Pha hi. Ei ih paitan tu a Philistine te in ih musak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama te ei kungah hong pai nuam a, ngakin hong sawl le ih omna mun san ah ih om nginge tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang amate kungah pai in hong sawl le ih pai tu hi, banghang ziam ci le tuasia sia Topa ii ngal zaw natu lim hong piakna hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabangin amate sia Philistine te in mu in, “En vun! Hebrew mite pawlkhat leihawng sung a bukna pan hong pusuak hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in Jonathan le tangvalpa oksan in, “Hi sungah hong paito tavun! Kong son nop khat om hi!” ci in sam hi. Jonathan in tangvalpa munah, “Hong zui ta'n. Topa in amate tungah Israel te zawna hong pia zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jonathan sia mualciangh pan a khut le a khup taw bokvak in kaato a, tangvalpa in zui hi. Jonathan in Philistine te simin vaatvawk a, tangvalpa in zongh tua teng that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kithalupna masa phitbel tuasung acre lang bang a zaina munah Jonathan le tangvalpa in mihing kul bang thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngam sungah a om Philistine te theampo lau ngawp uh hi; a suttolte le ngiaphual a om ngalkapte lau in liing uh hi; lei liingin patauna lianpi om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamin ngamsung Gibeah encik in a om, Saul ii mite in Philistine te lungmangin a tai mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul in a mite munah, “Ih ngalkap teng sim sin vun, akua om ngawl ziam, kan vun,” ci hi. Amate in tuabangin ahi uh ciang Jonathan le a ngalhiam pua tangvalpa a om ngawl hunlam he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ephod sia hi sungah hong paipui tavun,” Saul in thiampipa Ahijah munah ci hi. (Tua ni in Ahijah in tuasia Israel mite mai ah pua hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saul sia Ahijah taw a papau laitakin, Philistine ngiaphual ah nasia buai vaial ahikom Saul in, “ Topa tung thu dok tu hun om nawn ngawl hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciangin ama le a mite sia amate khat le khat kitel meal ngawlin a kido Philistine te sim tuin hong kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hebrew mi pawlkhat Philistine te sang pang phot a, amate ngiaphual ah a paikhawm sa te sia hong heak kikin, Saul le Jonathan taw hong kop kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ephraim mual tungah a om a dangte in Philistine te tai keak hi ci-in za ahikom amate zongh hong kipawlin Philistine te sim a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bethaven kalh dongin do uh hi. Topa in tua ni in Israel hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel te sia tua ni in ngilkial in thazawm uh hi, banghang ziam cile Saul in ciliap huai kiciamna taw thupia hi: “Ka ngalte tungah phulaakna ka nei uh mateng tu ni in an a ne sia peuma haamsiatna thuak tahen,” ci hi. Tua ahikom kuama in ni buppi bangma ne ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A vekpi in thingtaam khat sung hong thengin, mun theampo ah khuaitui mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Taam sungah khuaitui dimteak ahihang kuama in a ne bua hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Saul ii haamsiatna sia kiita uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang Jonathan in a pa ii haamsiatna taw a tawnna za ngawl a, tua ahikom a ciangkang toai sia taw khuaiphaanglu sung sunin khuaitui tawm ne hi. Thakhat thu in ama hong hat zawhiat paih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang a mite khat in, “Ko sia ngilkial in pukhong khu hi, ahihang na pa in haamsiatna taw hong tawng a, ‘Tuni in an a ne peuma tungah haamsiatna tung tahen hong ci hi,’ ” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Ka pa in ih mite tungah bang zata in, a kiitakhuai mama in ngamta thong ziam? En vun, khuaitui tawm ka neak hu in bangza in ka om nuam tuam paih ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ih mipuite in ngalte a zaw uh ciang a laak uh ante ne le tuni bangza in pha tuam seseam tu ziam? Philistine te bangza a tamzaw that zo tu hi ziam, ngaisun vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ni in Israel te in Philistine te zo a, Michmash pan Aijalon dong lam khom teakin sim uh hi. Hi sia hunin Israel te sia ngilkial in zawm mama uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tua ahikom amate in ngalte khut sung pan a matte la tu in del uh hi, tuu le kealte la in tua munah ngo paih in, a chi thai ngawlin a sa ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Saul munah hi thu kikhia a, “En in, mipite in sa le a chi ne khawmin Topa tungah mawna vawt hi,” ci uh hi. Saul au in, “No sia pawl zuakte nu hi! Suangtum lian khat hi sung keima kungah hong liik tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in thupiakna dang khat nei a, “Mite sungah pai tavun a, khui le tuute hi sungah hong paipui natu sonsiat vun. Amate in tua ngante ngoin hi sung ma ah ne tu hi; amate in sa le chi neak khopna taw Topa tungah maw thei ngawl het tu hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom tua ni takin amate in a nganno te hong paipui a tua munah ngo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Saul in Topa atu biaknatau khat sa a, a masabel a vawt biaknatau ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Saul in a mite munah, “Zan lai paisuk in, Philistine te sim tawng, khuavak dong a neisa te phuulin, thatlum siat tawng,” ci hi. “Phabel tu na up bang po vawt in,” ci in amate in zo uh hi. Ahizong thiampipa in, “Pathian dongh phot tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul in Topa dongh a, “Philistine te ka sim tu ziam? Ko nong zosak tu ziam?” ci hi. Ahihang Pathian in tua ni in zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Saul in mipi lampuite munah, “Hi sungah hong pai tavun a, tuni in bang mawna vawt hi ziam, kan vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel zawna hong pia a nungta Topa taw kamciam vawt khi hi, ka tapa Jonathan keak ahizong, a maw sia kithatlum tu hi,” ci hi. Ahihang kuama in bangma son ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaciang Saul in amate tungah, “Na vekpi in zia lai ah va ding tavun, Jonathan le kei hi sungah kong ding tu uh hi,” ci hi. Amate in, “Phabel tu na up bang po vawt in,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Saul in Topa Israel ii Pathian munah, “ Topa , banghangin tuni ka pau hong zo ngawl ni ziam? Topa , Israel ii Pathian awng, a thiangtho suangte panin hong zo ta'n. Tua mawna sia Jonathan ahibuale kei mawna ahile, Urim panin hong zo ta'n; ahizong na Israel mite ii mawna hang ahile Thummim panin hong zo ta'n,” ci hi. A zona sia Jonathan le Saul tungah tu a, mipite kithiangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Saul in, “Ka tapa Jonathan le kei akua hi zaw khu ziam hong khensat ta'n,” ci hi. Tuaciang Jonathan kikawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Saul in Jonathan munah, “Bang vawt thong ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Jonathan in, “Ka ciang toai sia taw khuaitui tawm ne khi hi. Hi lai ah om khi hi — a thi tu in kinging khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Saul in Jonathan tungah, “Nang hong kithisak bua le, keima Pathian in hong vaatlum tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahihang mipite in Saul munah, “Israel atu ngalzawna lianpi hong neisak Jonathan sia thisak tu hi ziam? Hi thei ngawl hi! A nungta Topa min taw kamciam pia khu hi, a luzang samzam khat zongh sumsi thei ngawl tu hi. Tuni in a sep a vawt sia, Pathian ii huna taw a vawt hi,” ci uh hi. Tuabangin mipite in Jonathan sia thi natu pan hun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Saul in Philistine te del nawn ngawl a, amate ngam ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Saul sia Israel kumpipa a sua zawkciang, mun theampo ah a ngalte sim hi: Moab, Ammon le Edom mite, Zobah kumpite le Philistine te do hi. Ngal a simna po ama in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ama in hangsan takin ngalsim a, Amalek te ngawngawn zo hi. Ama in Israel te hong kisimna theampo panin hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Saul ii tapate sia, Jonathan, Ishvi le Malchishua ahi hi. Ama ii tanu uzaw sia ii min Merab hi a, a nau zaw sia Michal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A zi sia Ahimaaz ii tanu Ahinoam hi; a ngalkaphonpi ukpa sia a pano Ner ii tapa, a suapui sealh Abner ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Saul ii pa Kish le Abner ii pa Ner sia Abiel tate ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A nuntak sung tawntung Saul in Philistine te hangsan takin a sim kul hi. Tua ahikom a thahat, a hang pasal khat a mu na le ngalkap tumsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel in Saul munah, “A Israel mite kumpipa tu in nang sathau noai a Topa ii hong sawl sia keima khi hi. Tu in Topa Vaanglianpipa son teng ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Amalek te daan pia nuam hi, banghang ziam cile amate ii taanghpupite in Israel mite Egypt ngam pan a pusua lai in na nalh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kuan ta'n a, Amalek te a neisa theampo uh taw a vekpi in susia cip in. Na khat zongh khoaikhe heak in: pasal, numei, patang le nausen; a khui, a tuu, a kalaoh le a laate thatlum siat in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul in a ngalkapte Telem ah khawmtua in sit hi. Israel panin ngalkap 200,000 le Judah pan 10,000 pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang ama le a ngalkapte Amalek te khuapi ah kuanin ngun luanna munko khat pan a suam tu in pang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a taanghpupite in Egypt pan a pusua uh lai in Israel te tungah a dik Ken te tungah a kidop natu kam thaak hi. Tuate munah, “Pai vun a Amalek te nusia vun, amate taw cipin kong thalup ngawl natu in tai vun,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Ken te in khua a nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul in Amalek te, Havilah pan Egypt nisuana Shur dongin zo a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama in Amalek kumpipa Agag a hingtang in man a, tuaciang a mite theampo thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang Saul le a mite in Agag ii nuntakna sia khoaikhe a, tuaciang a tuu le a khui a phabel teng, khuino le tuuno a phabel teng le na a pha theampo khe in, a man nei ngawl le a mannung ngawl teng bek susia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Samuel tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Saul sia kumpipa in ka koi sia khuangai khi hi; ama in kei hong nusia a, tuaciang ka thupiakna hong ni ngawl hi,” ci hi. Samuel thin uuk a, zan khua in Topa tungah pakaai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khuavak ni zing tuungin Saul zong tu in ama pai hi. Saul sia Carmel khua ah pai in tua munah ama atu in khansuang khat phut a, tua zawkciang Gilgal ah paisuak hi ci in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuel in Saul omna dong va pai in, Saul in muak a paupui hi, “ Topa in thupha hong pia tahen, Samuel awng! Topa thupiak ni khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samuel in, “Tua ahile khui ham aw le tuu ham aw te banghangin za khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul in, “Ka mite in Amalek te tung pan la hi. Tuu le khui a phabel teng la in Topa na Pathian tungah sangaw biakpiakna in nei sawm uh hi, a dang teng sia maaimot siat hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samuel in, “Na pau tawp in, tu zanin Topa ii kei hong son teng hong sonsawn tu khi hi,” ci in thupia hi. Saul in, “Hong son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel in, “Nangma le nangma sia thupi na kisak ngawl hang, nang sia Israel te ii lampui pa ni hi. Topa in Israel Kumpipa tu in sathau hong noi sa ni hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuaciang ama in nang sia tua a seksol Amalek te a lalcipsak tu in hong paisak hi. Amate na thalup siat dong sim tu ni hi ci in thu hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahile banghangin a thu ni ngawl ni ziam? Banghangin a neisa uhte phuul tu in kinaw liang in Topa ii diksak ngawl tu in ngamta ni ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul in, “ Topa thu ni khi hi. Hong sawl bangin ka kuan a, kumpipa Agag ka ciapui hi, Amalek te theampo ka thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang ka mite in tuu le khui a matte sung pan a phabel teng a thatlum bua uh hi; tuabang ahi luangin Topa na Pathian tungah sangaw biakpiakna tu in, hi sung Gilgal ah hong paipui uh hi,’ ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Samuel in, “Thunitna ahibuale biakpiaknate le sangaw biakpiakna Topa in koisia dei zaw ziam? Ama tungah tuu phabel taw sangaw biakpiakna sangin thunitna phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama leedona in bum le aitoaina bangma in sia a, kiphatsakna sia milim biakna za in mawna hi. Nangma in Topa thupiakna nial na hi man, ama in nang ii kumpi na hina hong nial zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hi hi, maw zo khi hi,” ci in Saul in zo kik hi. “ Topa thu piakna le nong hilna te ni ngawl khi hi. Ka mite ka kiitak manin amate dei bangin ngamta khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang tu in ka mawna hong maisak ta'n a, Topa ka biak thei natu in kei taw paikhawm kik tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nang taw pai kik ngawl tu khi hi. Nang in Topa thupiaknate nial na hikom, ama in nang sia Israel kumpipa na hina hong nial zo hi,” ci in Samuel in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Samuel sia ama nusia tu in hong kiheak a, ahihang Saul in a puanpuasilh pan a let le a puan ki eau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Samuel in ama munah, “ Topa in Israel kumpi ngam sia tuni in na khut sung pan hong eaukeaksak zo hi, tuaciang nang sangin a phazaw mihing khat tungah pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel ii minthang kumpi Pathian sia leilot ngawl, a thin kheal ngawl hi. Ama sia mihing khat hi ngawl hi — a thin kheal ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Saul in, “Keima maw zo khi hi. Ahihang ka mite ii lampuite le Israel theampo ii mai ah zatakna beak hong lak ta'n. Keima taw hong heak kik ta'n a, Topa na Pathian ka biak thei natu hong hi ta'n,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahikom Samuel sia Saul taw heak kik a, tuaciang Saul in Topa bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Kumpipa Agag hi lai kei kungah hong paipui tavun,” ci in Samuel in thupia hi. Agag sia ama kungah lau vadil in hong pai a, “Thi tu sia bangza in na ziam?’. ci in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Samuel in, “Na namsau in nute tam mama ta selsak ahi bangma, tu in na nu zongh tasel tu hi,” ci hi. Tuabangin Samuel in Agag sia Gilgal biaknatau mai ah neensem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Samuel sia Ramah ah pai a, Saul kumpipa sia Gibeah khua a inn ah cia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Samuel ii nuntak sungah kumpipa a mu kik ngei nawn bua hi; ahihang ama tungtaang khuangai hi. Saul sia Israel kumpipa in a koi hu in Topa hee hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Samuel munah, “Saul tungtaang bang tanvei khuangai tu ni ziam? Israel kumpipa a hina nial zo khi hi. Ahihang tu in olive thau tawm la in a, Bethlehem khua ah pai in Jesse a kici pasal khat sia kungah haw ta'n, banghang ziam cile ama ii tapate khat kumpi tu in teal zo khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Banghang tuabangin ngamta thei tu khi ziam, Saul in tua thu za le keima hong that tu hi,” ci in Samuel in dongh hi. Topa in, “Khuino khat keng in a Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna tua munah ka vawt tu ci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sangaw biakpiakna ah Jesse sam in a, tuaciang na sep tu teng kong son tu hi. Keima ii kong son tu pa sia kumpi in sathau noai tu ni hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Samuel in Topa sawl teng vawt tu in Bethlehem ah pai hi, tua munah ama muak tu in khuapi lampuite liing liangin hong pai uh a, “A mukhol thei pa awng, nong hawna sia kilem thu hi buang hi ngawl ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in, “Hi hi, Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna khat vawt tu in kong pai hi. Kithiansua vun a, hong pai tavun,” ci in zo hi. Ama in Jesse le a tapate zongh amate le amate kithiansua tu in sawl a, sangaw biakpiakna munah sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate hong thet ciang, Samuel in Jesse ii tapa Eliab mu a, “Sia pa, hi sung Topa mai ah a dingpa sia ama ii teal sia hi nanak tu hi,” ci in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in ama munah, “A tun saanna le a mealphatnate awlmawk heak in. Ama sia nial zo khi hi, banghang ziam cile, mihing thukhen bangin thu ka khen bua hi. Mihing in a pua sang pianzia bek en hi, ahihang kei ka hile a thinsung ka en hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesse in a tapa Abinadab samin Samuel kungah paipui hi. Ahihang Samuel in, “Hi bo, Topa in ama zongh teal ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesse in tua zawkciang Shammah paipui hi. “Hi bo, Topa in ama zongh teal bo,” Samuel in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi bangin Jesse in a tapa salite Samuel kungah paipui hi. Samuel in ama tungah, “Hi bo, Topa in hite kuama teal ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang Samuel in ama tungah, “Tapa dang na nei lai ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Jesse in, “A nobel sia om lai hi, ahihang ama sia tuute cingin om hi,” ci in zo hi. Samuel in, “Hi sungah hong pai natu sawl in,” ci hi. “Sangaw biakpiakna sia ama hong pai mateng kivawt ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesse in ama samsak hi. Ama sia tangval mealpha, a ciidam, a mit tee vakil khat ahi hi. Topa in Samuel tungah, “Hi sia pa hi — sathau noai in!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuel in olive thau la in a suapuite mai ah David sathau noai hi. Thakhat ma in Topa thaa in David uk a, tua ni pan kipan ama taw omkhawm top hi. Tua zawkciang Samuel sia Ramah ah heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa thaa in Saul nusia a, tuaciang Topa ii paisak thaa ngilo khat in ama vawtsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A naseamte in ama munah, “ Topa ii hong paisak thaa ngilo khat in nang hong vawtsiat sia he khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom thu hong pia ta'n, topa awng, tengtongh tum a thiam khat ka zong tu uh hi. Tua hile thaa ngilo sia nang tung hong thet ciang, tua pa in tengtongh hong tum tu a, nangma na dam kik tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in amate thupia a, “Tumthei tum thiam khat zong tavun a, keima kungah hong paipui tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama a cingte khat in, “Bethlehem khua mi Jesse in music a thiam tapa khat nei hi. Ama sia a hang, a mealpha, ngalkap pha khat hi a, thu son thiam khat zongh ahi hi. Topa sia ama taw omkhawm hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul in kamtaite Jesse kungah paisak a, “Na tapa David, tuu cing thei sia hong puak ta'n,” cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesse in David sia Saul kungah paisak a, kealngual khat, anluum a pua laa khat le savun ip dim sapittui kengsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David sia Saul kungah pai a, a naseam in tum hi. Saul in ama diksa mama a, a ngalhiamte pua tu in teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Saul in Jesse kam thaak hi: “David diksa khi hi. Keima ii naseam in hi munah hong omsak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hun pan kipan Pathian ii puak thaa ngilo sia Saul tungah a thet simin David in a tengtongh tum hi. Thaa ngilo in nusia a, Saul sia a om nuamtuamin hong dam kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah ngam Socoh khua ah Philistine te ngalsim tu in hong kikhawmtua uh hi; Socoh le Azekah kilaklaw Ephes Dammim a cina mun khat ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul le Israel te kikhawmtua in Elah Kuam sungah ngiaphual saat a, Philistine te a do tu in kinging uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philistine te mual khat tungah kingual a, Israel te sia a dang mual tung khat ah kingual in, a kilaklaw ah kuam khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gath khuapi pan Goliath a kici pasal khat Israel te thato tu in Philistine ngiaphual panin hong pusuak hi. Ama sia a tun meter 3 dektak saang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kilogramme 57 bang a ngit ngaldalna taaupuan silhin taau lukhu khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A peangte zongh taau ngaldalna taw tuam a, a liangko ah taau tei khat kua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A teibul sia thiamtana pumlawng cia pha a, a teipalh sia kilogramme 7 bang ngit hi. Ama mai ah lum a puaksak ngalkap khat pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Goliath ding in Israel te ausan a, “Tuasung ah bang hi nu ziam, ngalsim tu in kingual nu ziam? Saul ii silate awng, kei sia Philistine mi khat khi hi! Na mite khat kei taw kido tu in hong teal tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in kei hong zo in hong thatlum le, ko sia na sila suak tu khu hi; ahihang keima in zo in a ma ka that zo le no sia koma sila suak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu mama in Israel ngalkaphonpi hong thato khi hi. Kei taw a kido ngam tu khat hong kidok ka sin vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul le a mite in hi thu a zaak uh ciang patau ngawp uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />28 David sia Jesse ii tapa hi a, Judah ngam Bethlehem khua pan Ephrath mi ahi hi. Jesse in tapa liat nei a, Saul kumpi a sep lai hunin ama sia huai mama zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tapa lianbel thum te Saul taw ngalsimin kuan zo uh hi. A ubel sia Eliab hi a, a zom sia Abinadab, a thumna sia Shammah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David sia a nobel hi a, a ubel thum teng Saul taw a om laitakin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David sia Bethlehem khua ah a pa ii tuute cing tu in cia vazek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Goliath in Israel te zing sim nitak sim, ni sawmli sung sitset thato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Jesse in David munah, “Hi an em min sa kilogramme sawm le anluum sawm teng la in na ute omna ngiaphual ah manlang in va pai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang hi noaikhal sawm teng sia a ngalkap mang pa va puak ta'n. Na ute bangbangin om ziam hong kan ta'n a, amate taw ciidam in na kimuna nong lak natu in bang ziam khat hong ciapui ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa Saul, na ute le Israel dang teng sia Elah Kuam ah Philistine te do in om hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A zing ciang zing tuungin David tho in, tuute a en tu mi dang khat vaipuak pia a nguai an heang in, Jesse sawlna ah pai hi. Israel te ngalmai ah ngalsim tu in kuan a, hanla a sam laitakin David theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Philistine te le Israel te in kido natu mun la a, kimaitua in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in a nguai an teng an zeak ngalkapmang pa aap a, ngalmai ah tai in a ute kungah bangbang na hi uh ziam ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama te a kipaupui laitakin Goliath sia mai ah hong pai a, nidang a hi ngei bangma in Israel te thato hi. Tuaciang David in ama aw za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel te in Goliath a mu uh ciang lau in taikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ama en vun! A thatona ngai vun! Kumpipa Saul in ama a that zo sia tel lian khat piak tu in kamciam hi; kumpipa in a teenpui tu in a tanu pia si tu a, a pa bangkua zongh phiangshia piasak ngawl tu hi,” ci in amate khat le khat kison uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David in ama kung nai a omte munah, “Hi Philistine pa that zo a, Israel mite mindaina pan a suaktasak sia in bang nga tu ziam? A peuma in hi Pathian he ngawl Philistine pa sia akua ka hi ci a, a nungta Pathian ii ngalkaphonpi nalh ngam ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in Goliath a that pa ii nga tu teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />David ii a u lianbel Eliab in David le mite kipaupui na teng za hi. Ama thin uuk a David tungah, “Nang hi sungah bang hong zong ni ziam? Dui sungah na tuute akua in keam tu ziam? Kin ngawl tu teng a kin, nang thong awng! Ngal kido en tu bekin hong pai na hi ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />David in, “Tu in bang vawt na khi ziam? Thu khat beak zongh hong dongh thei ngawl tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in midang khat sang nga in tua teng ma dongh hi, a dok simin tuabang vive ma in kizo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pawlkhat in David ii pau teng za a, Saul tungah son uh hi, tuaciang Saul in ama samsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David in Saul munah, “Kumpipa awng, hi Philistine pa sia kuama ii kiitak kul ngawl hi! Keima pai in ama do tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Saul in, “Hi ngawl hi, bangbangin ama do zo tu ni ziam? Nang sia patang hi lai in, ama sia a khan tawntung ngalkap a seam sa hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />David in, “Kumpipa awng, kei sia ka pa ii tuute a keamcing pa khi hi. Tawpi in ahizong vompui in ahizong tuuno khat hong tuasak sim ma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />del in ka sim a, tuuno ka suatak hi. Tuasia ciang tawpi ahibuale vompui in kei sang hong zot ciang, a longtawl pan zamh in, ka teak lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tawpite le vompuite ka that zo a, a nungta Pathian ii ngalkap hon a nalh pa, Pathian he ngawl Philistine pa sia tuabang ma in vawt tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa in tawpi le vompuite panin hong hut sa khi hi; ama in hi Philistine pa khut sung pan hong hun tu hi,” ci hi. Saul in, “Pha hi, va pai ta'n a, Topa nang taw hong omkhawm tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama ii ngaldalnate David pia a; David lu tungah taau lukhu khusakin, ngaldalna puan silhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />David in Saul ii namsau sia a ngaldalna puan tung pan kua in lampai tu a kisin le a pai thei bua hi, banghang ziam cile ama in tuate silh ngeingawl hi. Saul munah, “Hiteng taw kei ngalsim thei ngawl tu khi hi. Kei kingeinasee ngawl khi hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom tua teng suutsiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama in a tuu cinna ciang la in, lui sung pan suangtang ngil nga tawmin, a thung sungah heang hi. A saili taw a kinging sa in Goliath taw kisi tu in kuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Philistine pa sia David sangah a kalsuan hong kipan a, a lumtoaipa sia a mai ah pai hi. A nai vaial in ama hong pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama in David pha takin a et zawkciang simmawkna taw hong kidim hi, banghang ziam cile David sia a etlawm a mealpha patang khat hi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in David munah, “Na ciang toai sia bang tu ziam? Kei sia ui po hong sa ni ziam?” ci hi. Ama ii pathian min taw David haamsiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ama in David thato a, “Hong kuan ta'n, na pumpi sia vacimte le ngamsate neak tu in pia tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />David in, “Nang sia kei hong sim tu in namsau, teipi le thikzum taw hong kuan ni hi, ahihang kei ka hile na nalh tawntung sa Topa Vaanglianbelpa, Israel ngalkaphonpite ii Pathian min taw hong kuan khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuni mama in Topa in nang sia keima khut sungah hong pia tu hi; kong zo tu a, na lu ka tan tu hi. Tuaciang Philistine ngalkapte luang sia vacimte le ngamsate neak tu in ka pia tu hi. Tuasia tak ciang leitung buppi in Israel ii Pathian khat a nei hunlam he tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />tuaciang hi sungah a om mi sim in, a mite a hut natu in Topa in namsau le teite kisamh ngawl hi ci in musak tu hi. Ama sia ngalphual ah a zo pa hi a, no teng sia ko khutnuai ah hong koi tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Goliath in David sang zuan tu in hong kipan leleau hi, tuaciang David sia ama do tu in Philistine ngalmai sangah manlang in hong tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ama in a thung sung sawk in, a saili tang la a, Goliath kap hi. Goliath ii talki kha a, a lungu tamh in Goliath sia a khup lam in lei ah puksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuabangin namsau ngawl taw, saili le suangtang khat taw David in Goliath zo in thatlum hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama tai in Goliath tungah a din zawkciang Goliath ii namsau a paai sung pan dok a, a ngawng tan in that hi. Philistine te in a ngalhang pa thi a mu ciangin taimang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Israel mite le Judah mite au in amate del a, Gath le Ekron kongpite dong zuizen uh hi. Shaaraim paina lampi Gath le Ekron dong lamdung ah Philistine te liamin puk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Israel te in Philistine te a zuizenna pan hong cia kik ciang a ngiaphual phuulsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />David in Goliath lutang tawm in Jerusalem ah paipui hi, ahihang Goliath ii ngalhiamte sia ama puanbuk sungah keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Saul in Goliath taw kido tu in a pai David a mu ciang, a ngalkaphonpi ukpa Abner munah, “Abner awng, ama akua tapa ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Abner in, “Kumpipa awng, akua tapa ziam ngaisun zo ngawl khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Saul in, “Tua ahile va kan ta'n,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tua ahikom Goliath thatlum zo a, ngalphual ah David hong heak kik ciang in, Abner in Saul kungah paipui hi. David in Goliath lutang pua nginge lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Saul in, “Tangvalpa awng, nang akua tapa ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. David in, “Bethlehem khua mi na naseampa Jesse ii tapa khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul le David a thuson man zo hi. Tuasia zawkciang Saul ii tapa Jonathan sia David tungah nasia takin a lung tu a, ama le ama a ki it za in David hong it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul in David sia tua ni pan kipan keam in, a inn ah a cia kiksak nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonathan in David it mama ahikom a tawntung kilawmtat natu in kiciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a puantual silh lai sia suutin David pia hi, tua taw kikop in a ngaldalna puan, tuaciang a namsau, a thal le a kawngkhaute zongh pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David sia Saul ii puakna po ah a nasep theampo zo ahikom Saul in ngalkap mang khat in koi hi. Hisia in Saul ii ngalkap bute le a mite lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in Goliath a thalup zawkciang hong heak kik a, tuaciang ngalkapte inn ah hong cia kik laitakin Israel ngamsung khua theampo pan numeite in Saul kumpipa muak tu in hong pai uh hi. Amate lungnopna late sa in laam a, daalkual khuangnote le liamlote tum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A poai vawtna sungah numeite in lasa in, “Saul in a tul in that a, ahihang David in a tulsawm simin that hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul in hisia diksa ngawl a, a thin uuk mama hi. Ama in, “David atu in amate in a tulsawm simin that ci a, kei ciang a tul simin that hong ci bek hi. Amate in a kik ciang ama sia kumpipa suaksak tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua hi a, tua ni pan kipan sia ama in David eang a, telkhial vilvel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A zing ciang Pathian kung pan thaa ngilo khat in thakhat thu in Saul hong uk a, a inn sungah a thin amh khat bangin kitom ngawp hi. David sia ni simin a tum ngei tengtongh tutum a, tuaciang Saul sia tei khat toai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul in, “Pang taw cipin ama khaw let tong,” ama le ama kici a, ama in a tei taw niivei khaw hi; ahihang David in a khaw sim ma in pial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saul in David kiita hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in David ompui a, ama nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul in ama sia, a khualana ah ngalkap tulkhat uk tu in paisak hi. David in a mite ngalsimna sungah lampui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciang a sim theampo zo hi, banghang ziam ci le Topa in ama ompui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David ii zawnate Saul in heaksak a, kiita seseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Israel le Judah ngam a mihingte theampo in David it uh hi, banghang ziam cile tuabangin nasep a zo lampui thiam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Saul in David munah, “Hi sungah ka tanu u zaw Merab om hi. Ngalhang le ngalkap thumaan khat bangin keima na, hong sepsak in, Topa ii ngal dosak po lete na zi tu in ama hong pia tu khi hi,” ci hi. (Saul in ama ii David a thalup kul ngawl a, Philistine te ii hi bangin thalup tu in a ngaisun hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David in, “Kei akua hi a kumpipa ii maakpa ka sua natu ka bangkua bang hi na ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang David atu Merab sia mo in thaak tu hun hong thet peetma ciang Meholah pan Adriel ci pasal khat kipia zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul ii tanu Michal ahile David taw ki it a, hi thu Saul in a zaak ciang lungkim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama le ama hi bangin kici hi, “Michal sia David ka pia tu a; ama thaang ka sia natu ka tanu zangh tu khi hi, tuasia ciang Philistine te in ama thatlum tu hi.” Tua ahikom Saul in David munah a nii veina in, “Nang sia ka maakpa hi tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ngalkapmangte in ama munah hi bangin ci kusak hi. “Kumpipa sia nang tungah lungkim a, tuaciang a ulian theampo in nang dik hong sa hi; tu laitak sia a tanu na teenpui tu hunpha hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in David munah tu a teng son uh hi, tuaciang ama in, “Bangma a thupi sim thamman ngawl mizawng kei bang atu kumpipa ii maakpa sua tu sia kithupi vawtna lian lei hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Uliante in Saul munah David ci teng a son uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul in amate thupia in, “Kumpipa ii nang tung pan a dei mo man sia, a ngalte tung a phulam na in, Philistine mithi zakhatte ii vunteap hi,” cisak hi. (Hi sia Philistine te in David a thalup thei natu Saul ii ngealna ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul ii uliante in Saul pauna teng David tungah son kik a, David sia kumpipa maakpa a sua tu ngaisun in a lungdam hi. Kiteen tu ni a see ma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David le a mite kuan in Philistine te 200 thatlum uh hi. Ama in kumpipa mai ah amate vunteap teng paipui in a maakpa a sua thei natu in a mai pan sim siat hi. Tua ahikom Saul in a tanu Michal sia David taw kiteang tu in a piak kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Saul in David taw, Topa omkhawm a, a tanu Michal zonghin David it ci in telthiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in David kiita seseam a, a nuntak lai teng ngal in nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Philistine ngalkaphonpite hong pai in sim bul hi, ahihang kidona theampo ah David sia Saul ii ngalkap mang dangte sangin ngalzo thei zaw hi. Ta sia taw kizui in David hong minthang mama hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul in a tapa Jonathan le a uliante theampo tungah David thalup tu a ngealna son hi. Ahihang Jonathan in David it mama ahikom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama munah, “Ka pa in nang hong thatlum tu in hanciam hi. Zingsang ciangin kidawm in; kuama heak ngawlna mun khat ah buu in a, tuak ah om top in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na bukna lo sung ka pa kungah pai in ka ding tu a, nangma ii thu ka son tu hi. Thu thak khat pawpo ka mu le kong hesak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan in Saul tungah David pok in, “Topa awng, na naseampa David tungah khial tha heak in. Ama in nang tungah hong khial ngeingawl hi; tuabang hi kana teng ci bua hing, a sep a vawt theampo nangma atu hu na lianpi vive hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Goliath a thalup lai zongh in, ama ii luangkhaam a, tuaciang Topa in Israel te atu zawna lianpi nga hi. Tua na mu ciangin na lungdam hi. Tua ahile banghangin, a maw ngawl khat tungah tu in khialna vawt nuamin, bangma a thu om ngawl bul David thatlum nuam ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jonathan ci teng Saul in tel thei a, David that ngawl tu ci in Topa min taw kiciamna vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jonathan in David sam a, a thu theampo son hi; tuaciang Saul kungah ama paipui in a sep maksak lai bangin David in kumpipa na seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Philistine te taw ngal hong piang kik hi. David in sim a, nasia takin zo ahikom, amate taikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Topa kung pan thaa ngilo khat in Saul uk hi. Ama sia a inn sungah tei khat toai in to a, tuaciang David sia tengtongh tumin tua munah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul in David sia pang taw cipin a tei taw khaw hi, ahihang David in pial in a tei sia pang tungah po hi. David tai in suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zan ma in Saul in pasal pawlkhat David inn encik tu le zingsang ciang ama thatlum tu in paisak hi. David ii zi Michal in a kidop natu in sonkhol a, “Tuni tak na kiheam buale zingsang ciang thi tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A zi in khelki panin khiasuk a, ama tai in suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Michal in a innkuan ii biak milim sia la in, lupna tungah a sial zawkciang, kealmul taw a kivawt lukham khamhsak in sitna khat taw siin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul ii mite in David that tu in hong pai uh ciang, Michal in ama a ciina hi ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Saul in paisak kik a, amate mama ii David a etcian natu thupia hi. Ama in, “A lupna taw hi sungah hong zawng tavun, keima that tu khi hi,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate inn sungah pai kik a, lupna tungah innkuan ii biak milim sia kealmul lukham khamhin a om mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in Michal munah, “Banghang hi bangin kei hong theamin, ka ngalpa suaktasak ni ziam,” ci in dongh hi. Ama in, “A suatak natu hu bua leng, kei kong that tu hong ci hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David suakta in Ramah khua, Samuel kungah pai in Saul ii ama a vawtna te a vekpi in son hi. Tua zawkciang ama le Samuel sia Naioth ah pai in tua munah taam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David sia Ramah khua sung Naioth ah om hi ci in Saul tungah kison hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tua ahikom ama man tu in mihing pawlkhat paisak hi. Amate in Samuel a lampui in nei a, kamsaang honkhat laamin au in a om mu uh hi. Tuasia ciang Pathian thaa in Saul ii mite uk a, amate zongh a lap a au hong kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in hi thu a zaak ciang kamtai pawlkhat pai thuasak a, amate zongh laam tu au tu in hong kipan uh hi. Ama in kamtaite a thum veina paisak a, amate zongh tuabang ma in ngamta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang ama mama Ramah ah pai tu in vai ding hi. Secu ah tuikhuk lian khat a thet ciangin Samuel le David koi sungah om ziam, ci in dongh a, amate Naioth ah om hi ci in kison hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama tuak sangah a pai ciang Pathian thaa in ama zongh uk a, Naioth dong lam tawntung laamin au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in Samuel omna ah a puan suutin laam in au a, a pumnguak in tua ni le tua zan lum hi. (Hisung panin, “Saul ngawngawn kamsaang suak zo ziam?” a ci paunak hong piang hi.)
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Ramah khua Naioth panin David tai a, Jonathan kung zuan hi. Ama in, “Kei a bang vawt na khi ziam?Bang khialna lian vawt khi ziam? Na pa tungah bang tat khialna ka nei hu in kei hong that nuam liang ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Pathian in na thi tu oai ngawl hi! Thupi kale thupi ta buale, ka pa in a sep a vawt theampo kei hong son a phualseal ngeingawl tu hi. Tuabang ma hi ngawl ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahizong David in, “Kei bangza in hong it na hi sia na pa in tel mama hi, tuaciang na pa in a ngealnate nang hong heaksak ngawl natu khensat zo hi, banghang ziam ci le nasia takin na thinna tu hi. A nungta Topa taw kiciam ngam in kong son nop pan, kei sia ka thi natu kal khat bek in samh hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Nangma uk babangin seam tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in, “Zing ciang sia Tha Thak Poai ni hi. Tuaciang kei sia kumpipa taw an nekhawm tu in hong kingaisun hi. Ahizong nangma in phamaw na sa bua nale lo sungah pai in thai nitak sang dong buu tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na pa in sabuai ah ka to ngawl hunlam hong phawk le Bethlehem khua ah a innkuan bup atu in kumcin sangaw biakpiakna vawt tu hun ahi hu in kei tungah manlang takin a cia natu hong ngen hi ci in na son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Pha hi,’ a ci le kei ngammuang tu khi hi; ahihang ama hong thin uuk le kei hong susia tu in khensat ahi sia na he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nong hesuakna in, hi a thiangtho kamciamna kei tungah nong piak sia na kho let in. Ahizong keima mama a maw ka hile nangma in hong thatlum ta'n. Banghangin na pa ii hong thalup tu in hong paipui tu ni ziam?” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Tuabangte ngaisut zongin nei vet heak in! Ka pa in nang hong susia nuam ci in he tatak leng hong son ngawl tu khi ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang David in, “Tua ahile na pa ii thin uuk awsua taw hong zo le hong zo ngawl sia akua in kei hong hesak tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Lo sungah pai ka tawng,” ci in zo hi. Tuabangin amate pai uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jonathan in David munah, “Israel ii Topa Pathian sia ih tetti hi hen! Zing ciang, hi hun le a zing kik ciangin ka pa dongh tu khi hi. Ama ii nang hong ngaisutzia a pha le kong zasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in nang, suksiat hong sawmin, tua thu kong hesak bua a, kong suaktasak buale Topa in kei hong vaatlum tahen. Topa sia ka pa taw a omkhop bangin nang taw zong hong omkhawm tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nungta in ka om le, a thiangtho na kamciamna keam in a, kei tungah hong thumaan ta'n; ahihang ka thi le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka innkuanpuite tungah tuabang thumaanna na lak tawntung in. Tuaciangin Topa in na ngalte a vekpi in a maaimot zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ei ii khat le khat tungah ih kamciam sia peal ngawlin kho lai tahen. Tuasia na ciampeal le Pathian in nang daan hong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khatvei ma Jonathan in ama a it natu David in kamciam piasak kik hi, banghang ziam cile Jonathan in David sia ama pumpi a it za in it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang Jonathan in, “Zing ciang Tha Thak Poai ahiciang an neakna ah om buale teh, na om ngawl hunlam kician tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thai ciangin na om ngawl hunlam kitel seseam tu hi; tua ahikom va pai in tu nung a na bukna suang kholna lia ah na buu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua suangkhol sia phutuun bangin thaltang tang thum taw kong kap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang ka naseampa munah tua thaltangte zongin ka sawl tu hi. Tuaciang ama munah, ‘En in, thaltangte nangma ii hi sangah om hi, tawm in,’ ka ci le nangma ngammuang takin hong pusuak thei tu ni hi. A nungta Topa taw ka kiciam hi, na lau tu bangma om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang ama munah, ‘Thaltangte nangma ii langkhat ah om hi,’ ka ci le na tai in, banghang ziam ci le Topa in nang hong kiheamsak ahi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eima khat le khat kamciam ih kipiakna sia Topa in ih kepcing tawntung natu in hong piangsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahikom David sia lo sungah buu hi. Tha Thak Poai ah Saul kumpipa anneakna ah hong pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuaciang ama to ngeina mun pang hui ah to hi. Abner sia ama kungah to a, Jonathan sia ama taw kimaingat in to hi. David tona sia awng thong hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ahihang tua ni in Saul in bangma son ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile, “Ama bang khat po tat hi tha tu hi, tuaciang a zeksa ngeina taw kisai in thiang ngawl po zongh hi thei tu hi,” ci in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tha Thak Poai khuavak ni in, David ii tona awngthong lai a, tuaciang Saul in Jonathan munah, “Banghangin David in zeini zongh, tuni zongh an ne tu in hong pai ngawl ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Bethlehem khua ah a pai natu in kei munah hong ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Nong hesuakna in hong paisak ta'n, banghang ziam cile ka innkuan uh in sangaw biakpiakna poai khua sungah vawt tu khu hi, tuaciang ka suapuipa in tua munah om tu in thu hong pia hi. Tua ahikom ka ngualtamh na hi le hong paisak ta'n a, ka mealheakte taw hong kimusak ta'n,’ hong ci hi. Tua hu in ama sia na sabuai ah om thei ngawl hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Saul sia Jonathan tungah a thinso a, “Bangza ta in na nu in ngual langpan a thumaan ngawl ziam! Tu in David sangah pang na hi sia hong tel khi hi, tuaciang nangma le tua na nu min daisak ni hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David nuntak lai teng nang sia bangma hun hi ngam ii kumpipa suak ngeingawl tu na hi hunlam na he ziam? Tu in va pai ta'n a, hi sungah ama hong paipui ta'n — ama a thi kul hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Banghang thi liang tu ziam? Ama in bang seam na ziam?” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, Saul in Jonathan that nuamin tei taw khaw hi, tuaciang Jonathan in a pa ii David a thalup nop takpi hunlam tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jonathan thin uuk mama in sabuai pan dingto a, tua ni bup bangma ne ngawl hi — tuasia Tha Thak Poai a ni nii ni ahi hi. David huvau in ama nasia takin a thinnuam ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Saul in ama zawnsak vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A zingsang ciangin a thukim sa om bangma Jonathan sia David taw kisi tu in lo sungah pai hi. Ama in patang khat pai pui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tuaciang ama munah, “Thaltang ka kaa tu sia tai in va zong ta'n,” ci hi. Patang sia tai a, Jonathan in a thaltang khat patang ii mai a kalh tu in kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Patang pa in a thaltang tukna a thet ciang Jonathan in oksan a, “Thaltang sia a khuala zawna ah tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua munah ding top heak in! Manlang in!” ci hi. Patang no sia thaltang tawmin a topa kungah heak kik hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />a topa cinopna theampo a tel bua hi; Jonathan le David bek in he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonathan in patang sia a ngalhiam pia a, khua sungah ciapui in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Patang ii a nusiat zawkciang, David sia suangkholna nung panin dingto a, hong khupdin in a maitang lei pha in thumvei hong kun hi. Jonathan le ama kinamh in kap khawm uh hi; David ii khuangaina sia Jonathan aa sangin nasia zaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jonathan in David munah, “Pathian nang taw hong om tahen. Topa in nang le kei, nang ii suan le paalte le kei aa te khat le khat tungah a thiangtho kamciam ih vawt sa te hong keamcingsak thei tahen,” ci hi. Tua zawkciang David in nusia a, Jonathan sia khua sung zuan kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nob khua ah a om thiampi Ahimelech kungah David pai hi. Ahimelech a liing sa in ama muak tu in pai a, “Nangma nguakin hi sungah banghang hong pai ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kumpipa vai taw kei hi sungah kong pai hi,” ci in David in zo hi. “Ama in ka sep tu te kuama ka heaksak ngawl tu in hong paisak hi. Ka mite ahile mun khat ah kisiktua tu in ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua hi a, tu in nguai an bang teng nei ni ziam? Anluum nga ahibuale zong a dang na nei khat po hong pia ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thiampipa in, “Anluum thawthong nei ngawl khi hi, a kithiansua sa anluum bek nei khi hi; na mite in tu nai sungin numei taw a omkhawm bua na uh le tuate nga thei ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in, “Tuabang omkhawm ngawl hi, ka mite sia a kisawl thawthong khat ah seam tu a pai bek zong, a zeksa in amate le amate kithiangsak tawntung hi, tua ahile tu a ko hong kisawl tuamna ah ka pai uh ciang thiang seseam ngawl tu khu ziam?,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom thiampipa in David sia a thiangtho anluumte pia hi, banghang ziam cile anluum a nei sun teng Pathian a kipia hi a, sabuai thiang panin a kisot sa hi a, anluum thak taw a kilaih sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />(Saul ii Edom pan a tuucing ukpa Doeg sia tua ni in tua munah biakna vai sepna khat a khuangkhimsak tu in na om luilam hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Ahimelech munah, “Tei ahizong namsau ahizong khat kei nong piak tu na nei ziam? Kumpipa thupiakte in tuabang manlang tatakin hong paisak ahikom ka namsau ahizong ngalhiam dang khat po ahizong laak tu hun ka nei nawn bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahimelech in, “Elah Kuam sungah na thalup Philistine te Goliath ii namsau nei khi hi; tuasia ephod ii nungah puan taw kituun in om hi. Na dei le la in — hi sungah a om ngalhiam sia tuasia bekma hi,” ci in zo hi. David in, “Hong pia ta'n, tuasia sangin a phazaw namsau dang koima ah om ngawl hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuabangin David in Saul kung pan tai in, tua mun zongh nusia in, Gath ah kumpipa Achish kung zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa ii uliante in, “Hisia David hi kana ngawl ziam? Ama ii ngam sungah kumpipa hi ngawl ziam? Numeite a lap kawmin la a sak uh, ‘Saul in a tul in that a, David in a tulsawm in that hi’ a ci sia hi ngawl ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate ii kammalte in David thinsung nasia takin patausak hi, tuaciang ama in Kumpipa Achish sia kiita mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate a kiim le a paam ah hong om uh ciang David sia a thin kiamhsak in, a letcip nop uh ciang, mihing mawmaw te bangin kithoai hi; khuapi kongpite tung ngelh zazaan in, a khamul tungah a cil kaaisak dimdum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Achish in uliante munah, “En vun! Hisia pa mawmaw hi! Banghang kei kungah hong paipui nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing mawmaw a kicing khomkhat nei zo hi ngawl khi ziam? Hi lai ka bangkua sungah ama ii mawmawt ngamtatna te taw ka thin hong nawngkaisak tu in banghang midang khat hong paipui nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David sia Gath khuapi panin tai in Adullam khua nai suanghawng khat zuan hi. A suapuipate le a innkuanpui dangte in tua thu a zaak ciang ama pawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing a kinengniamte, leiba neite ahibuale lungkim ngawlna a nei pawpo in ama kungah zuanin, a vekpi a kingawm in pasal 400 bang pha a, ama sia amate lampui suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in tua mun panin Moab ngam Mizpah ah paitan a, Moab kumpipa munah, “Pathian in kei atu bang hong vawtsak tu ci ka heak dong, ka pa le ka nu sia nang kungah na omsak natu in hesuak kong ngen hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabangin David in a pa le a nu sia Moab kumpipa kungah nusia a, David ii suanghawng sung a buk lai teng amate tua munah om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciangin kamsaang Gad sia David kungah pai a, “Hi sungah om heak in; Judah ngam ah tu mama in pai in,” ci hi. Tua ahikom David in tua mun nusia in Hereth duisung zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Saul sia Gibeah ngamsung mualtung makeang kung khat nuai ah tei toai in om a, a ulian teng ama kiim ah dingin om hi. David le a mite sia kimu zo hi ci in ama tungah thu kiko a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaciang ama in a uliante munah, “Benjamin mite awng, ngai vun! David in note theampo lote le sapithuante hong pia in, ama ngalkaphonpi sungah ngalkap ulian hong pia tu in muangmaw nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia hu in kei suam tu hong sawm na hi uh ziam? Ka tapa tilteal in David taw a kipawl hunlam no sung pan khat zongh in hong son ngawl nu hi. Kuama in kei hong thinnuam maw ngawlin, keima mi khat ahi David in tu hun tatak ma in kei hong thalup natu hunpha khat zon saan a, ka tapa in ama hanthawn ahi hunlam hong son ngawl nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Doeg sia Saul ii uliante taw tua munah a dinkhop laitak ama in, “Nob khua ah Ahitub ii tapa Ahimelech thiampipa kungah David a pai mu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in bang teng vawt kul tu ziam ci in Ahimelech in Topa dongh a, tua zawkciang David an tawm pia in, Philistine mi Goliath ii namsau sia pia hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa Saul in thiampi Ahimelech le Nob ah thiampite ma ahi a mealheak teng samsak a, hong pai tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saul in Ahimelech munah, “Ahimelech awng, hong ngai ta'n,” ci hi. Ama in, “Nong sawl po seam tu khi hi, topa,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul in thu dongh a, “Nang le David in banghangin kei hong thasawm nu ziam? Banghangin ama an tawm le namsau pia in, Pathian munah ama atu thu doksak ni ziam? Tu in ama in kei hong langpan a, hong thalup natu hunpha khat ngakin a om laitak hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahimelech in, “David sia nangma nei a thumaanbel ulian hi! Ama sia na maakpa, nangma hong cingte ii ngalkap mang pa, tuaciang kumpipa inn sungah a om theampo ii a zatak mama pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi hi, ama atu Pathian tungah thu dongh peu khi hi, ahizong hisia a masa phitbel hi ngawl hi. Nang hong kithasawm na taw kisai in, kumpipa awng, kei ka hizong, ka innkuan sungah a dang khat pawpo ahizong maw hong suan thei ngawl tu ni hi. Hi thu huvau bangma he ngawl khi hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Ahimelech awng, nang le na mealheak theampo na thi uh kul hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama a cing, a kungah a dingte munah, “ Topa ii thiampite that vun! Amate in David taw kikum ku in, ama a taimang zongh he napi hong son ngawl hi,” ci hi. Ahihang amate in Topa ii thiampite thalup natu a khut tungsak nuam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul in Doeg munah, “Amate nangma that in!” ci a — tuasia ciang Doeg in thatlum siat hi. Tua ni in ephod a silh thei sa thiampi 85 that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saul in thiampite khuapi Nob khua sungah a teang dangte theampo zongh thalup natu thupia a: pasal, numei, patang le nausen, khuite, laate le tuute — tuate theampo kithat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang Abiathar a kici Ahimelech ii tapa khat suakta a, ama in David zuanin pawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul ii Topa thiampite a thalupna vai ama in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in ama tungah, “Tua ni in Doeg tua munah ka mu ciang, ama in Saul tungah a son vangiat tu ka heak ma hi. Tua ahikom, na mealheakte theampo ii thina sia keima hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima kungah hong om ta'n a, lau heak in. Saul in nang le kei hong thatlum khawm nuam hi, ahihang nang sia kei taw ngammuangin om tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistine te in Keilah khua sim a, a anthak laak sa te a nguksak uh sia David in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in Topa dongh a, “Philistine te sim tu in ka kuan tu ziam?” ci hi. “Hi hi, amate sim in a, Keilah hun in,” ci in Topa in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang a mite in David munah, “Hi lai Judah ah ih kiitak tu a khom om hi; Keilah ah pai in Philistine ngalkapte sim leang pha ngawl seseam tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom David in Topa dongh kik a, tuaciang Topa in, “Pai in a, Keilah sim tavun, banghang ziam cile Philistine te kong zosak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom David le a mite Keilah ah kuanin, Philistine te sim uh hi; amate in tam ma thatin, a ngannote laaksak uh hi. Tuabangin David in tua khuapi hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahimelech ii tapa Abiathar suakta in Keilah khua ah David a pop ciang ephod keng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David ii Keilah a zotna thu Saul tungah a kison ciang, “Pathian in ama sia ka khut sungah hong pia zo hi. David in ngalnanna luphung kongpite a nei khuapi sung sangah a tumna taw ama le ama thaang kisia zo hi,” Saul in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul in a ngalkapte samin, Keilah khua ah David le a mite uumci sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul ii amate sim tu in a ngealna thu David in a zaak ciang, thiampi Abiathar munah, “Hi sungah Ephod hong paipui ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David in, “ Topa Israel ii Pathian awng, kei na naseampa hu in Saul sia Keilah khua ah pai in suksiat sawm hi ci in za khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keilah khua mite in kei Saul khut sungah hong aap tu ziam? Ka zaak bangin Saul hong pai takpi tu ziam? Topa Israel ii Pathian awng, nong zo natu hesuak kong ngen hi!” ci hi. Topa in, “Saul hong pai tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tua ahile Keilah khua mite in kei le ka mite Saul khut sungah hong aap tu ziam?” ci in David in dongh kik hi. “Amate in no hong aap tu hi,” ci in Topa in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom David le a mite — a vekpi 600 khawng — Keilah khua thakhat ma in nusia a, paisuak uh hi. Saul in Keilah khua pan David a suatak hunlam a zaak ciang a ngealna kheal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziph khuapi naina duisung, mualtung ngam ah David buu in om hi. Saul in zong tawntung a, ahihang Pathian in David sia ama ii khut sungah a aap bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in Saul ii ama a thalup nopna sia phawk hi. David sia Ziph khua paam duisung, Horesh ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua mun ama kungah Jonathan pai a, Pathian ii sungsiatna a muan natu in hanthotna pia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuaciang ama munah, “Lau heak in, ka pa Saul in nang bangma hong law zo ngawl tu hi. Ama in nang Israel kumpipa tu hi a, kei sia nangma zom a zalian kik bel ka hi tu sia tel mama hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate nii khat le khat kilawmtatna in a thiangtho kamciam kipia hi. David sia Horesh ah taamin, Jonathan inn ah cia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ziph khuapi panin mihing pawlkhat Gibeah, Saul kungah hong pai in, “David sia Judah thangsang duisung, koma ngam Horesh a om Hachilah Mualtung ah buu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpipa awng, ama bangza in man nuam na hi sia hong he khu hi; tua ahikom koma ngam sungah hong pai ta'n, na mat thei natu koma in vawt hamtang tu khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in, “Kei tungah hong dik mama na hi uh ciang, Topa in thupha hong pia tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pai tavun a, khatvei ma hong telthiang tavun; ama koisung tatak ah om ziam, tua munah akua in mu ziam, a man in hong kan tavun. Ama sia kukal mama hi ci in za khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A bukna mun tatak hong zong tavun a, kei kungah thu hong puaksak paih nanak tavun. Tua zawkciang noma kong zui tu a, ama tua ngam sungah a om lai le Judah ngam buppi vai a kul zong ka zong tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate Saul mai ah pai a, Ziph ah heak kik uh hi. David le a mite Judah ngam thangsang duisung ngamtongta kuam, Maon duisung ah om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul le a mite in David zong tu in pusuak uh hi, ahizong ama in a thu za in, Maon ngampa sung mual khat zuan in tuak ah taam hi. Saul in hi thu a zaak ciang David zuizen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul le a mite sia mualpangh langkhat ah om in, a lang pangh a om David le a mite taw mual in daa hi. Saul le a mite in amate hong neak a, man dektak ahiciang, amate zong manlang takin tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawk bek lianin kamtai khat hong theng a, Saul munah, “Philistine te in ih ngam hong sim hi! Thakhat ma in hong heak kik ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul sia David a zuizenna tawlnga in, Philistine te do tu in kuan hi. Tua hu in tua mun sia Kikhenna Mual kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />David in tua mun nusia in Engedi ngam sungah buu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistine te a simna pan Saul hong cia kik ciang, David sia Engedi nai dui sungah om hi ci in Saul munah kison hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul in Israel ngamsung ngalkap phabel 3,000 la in David le a mite zong tu in Ngam Keal Suangpi ii nisuana sangah hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in tuukhawk pawlkhat taw a kinai lampi hui suanghawng khat ah awnghaw tu in tum hi. Tua sia David le a mite ii a sung tawngh ah a bukna suanghawng na hi luilam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in ama munah, “Tusia nangma ii hunpha hi! Topa in na ngalte nangma khut sungah kong koi tu hi hong ci sa hi, ama tungah na law nop po law thei tu ni hi,” ci uh hi. David bokvak in pai a, Saul heak ngawl lan in a puantual mong bek khat at tansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang tuasia hun laitakin David thinnuam ngawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama in a mite tungah, “ Topa ii kumpipa in a teal ka topa tungah siatna ka vawt ngawl natu Topa in hong keamcing tahen! Ama tawm zongh ka suksiat thaak ngawl tu kisam hi, banghang ziam cile Topa ii tealsa kumpipa ahi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom David in a mite sia Saul a sim ngawl natu in a thinzosak hi. Saul dingto a, suanghawng nusia in ama pai natu ah pai tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David pusuakin a nung panin zui a, “Kumpipa awng!” ci in ama biakpui hi. Saul hong kiheak a, tuaciang David lei ah bok suk in zatak a piak zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ama in, “Banghangin keima nang vawtsiat tu hanciam hi ci a, thu hong son mihingte thu ngai ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu ma hiat ma in Topa in nang sia suanghawng sung keima khut sungah hong piak sia nangma tatak ma in mu thei ni, hi. Ka mite pawlkhat in nang thatlum in hong sawl hi, ahihang khuangai huai kong sa a, tawm zongh nasak ngawl tu khi hi ka ci hi, banghang ziam cile nang sia Topa ii kumpipa tu in hong teal na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pa awng hong en ta'n, na puantual mong bek ka khut sungah ka toai sia en in! Hong thatlum thei khi hi, tuabang hi ngawlin hisia bek at keak zaw khi hi. Hisia in nang langpanin kong leedo nop ngawlna le nang bangma kong law nop ngawlna thu hong telsak tu hi. Nang tungah bangma hong khial ngawl napi kei hong that nuam in hong vaizui ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in ei nii akua maw hi ziam thu hong khen tahen! Kei tungah nong ngamtatna hu in Topa in nang daan hong pia tahen, banghang ziam cile nang sia bangma hong law ngawl tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Taanghkam teptee khat, ‘Siatna sia misiate bek in vawt hi’ a ci sia he ni hi. Tua ahikom nang sia bangma hong law ngawl tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel kumpipa ii a thalup nop sia en vun! A del thapaai sia bang ziam en vun! Ui thisa khat, uili khat hi lel ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ei ngeal akua maw hi ziam Topa in thu hong khen tu hi. Hi thu ama in hong en cian tahen, kei hong hung in, nang khut sung pan hong hun tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David ii thuson zawkciang, Saul in, “Ka ta David awng, nangma tatak ma ni ziam?” ci hi. Tuaciang ama hong kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David munah, “Nangma maan a, kei khial khi hi. Kei ii nang tungah khialna ta za kong nei kawmsung panin, hong dik mama ni hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu ni in nang sia kei tungah bangza in hong dik ni ziam ci in hong lak zo ni hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in na khut sungah kei hong aap hi napi nong thatlum bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing khat in a ngalpa man zo kasap vawtsia ngawlin bang tanvei suaktasak kik ngei ziam? Tuni in kei tungah nong vawt teng hu in Topa in nang thupha hong pia tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu in ka tel thu in nang sia Israel te kumpipa suak tu a, kumpi ngam sia nangma ukna nuai ah kizom suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang ka min le ka innkuan ii min a kimakngil bit ngawl natu in, ka suan ka paalte nong khoaikhetsak natu Topa min taw kamciam hong pia ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in tuabang ka hi tu hi ci in kamciam pia hi. Tuaciang Saul a inn ah cia kikin, David le a mite sia a bukna mun zuan kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel thi a, Israel mi bup hong pai in, ama nusiat hu in khuangai tek hi. Tua zawkciang ama ii teenna Ramah ah phum uh hi. Tua zawkciang Paran duisung ah David pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah Caleb ii phung sung pan Nabal a ci pasal khat om hi, ama sia Maon khua pan hi a, Carmel khua hui ah leitang nei hi. Ama sia a hau mama pa khat hi a, tuu 3,000 le keal 1,000 nei hi. A zi Abigail sia a mealhoi in pil hi, ahihang a pasal sia a iiciil a thin tom khat hi. Carmel khua ah Nabal in a tuute mul meet in om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaciang duisung ah a om David in ama ii thu za hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua ahikom ama in tangval sawm paisak a, Carmel ah Nabal zongsak in, nuksetna kam thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Nabal tungah amate pau natu teng hil a: “David in hong nukset hi, ka lawmpa awng, nangma atu, na innkuan bup atu le na neisa theampo atu in, a phabel deisakna hong zasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in nang sia tuumul meetin om ci hong za a, na tuucingte zongh ko taw omkhawmin, bangma kong law ngawl uh sia na heak tu ka dei hi. Carmel ah a om sung tawntung amate ii neisa na khat zongh kinguksak ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate dongh lete ahi bangin hong son tu hi. Poai khaam ni in ko hong pai khu hi, David in pha takin zin nong do natu hong ngen hi. Nong hesuakna in nong piak thei po ko, na naseamte le na it na lawmpa David hong pia ta'n,” cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David mihingte in hi kam vaithak teng David min suangin Nabal tungah son uh hi. Tua zawkciang amate in tua munah ngak uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciang Nabal in a khakbel ciangin, “David sia akua ziam? Za zongh za ngei bong! Ih ngamsung sia sila tai khawng taw tu laitak kidim hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka an le ka tui, ka tuumul meette atu ngan ka ngawte ii sa la in hong paina mun zongh ka heak ngawl mite pia ngawl tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David ii mite heak kikin Nabal ii ci teng David tungah son kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in, “Na namsau uh kua vun!” ci in thupia a, amate in tuabang ma in vawt uh hi. David zongh ama namsau kua in, tuaciang a mite 400 khawng taw kuan in, nungsang ah vanhte taw 200 nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nabal ii naseamte khat in Nabal zi Abigail munah, “Na za zo ziam? David in duisung pan kamtaite paisak a, ih topa munah, nuksetna kam puaksak kasap ama in ci zazaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabang hi nave, amate ei tungah hong dik mama uh hi; ko hong nawngkaisak ngeingawl hi, tuaciang lo sungah amate taw ka om sung tawntung, ka neisa uh bangma hong kinguksak ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuu honte cingin ka om uh laitakin amate in sun taw zan taw ko hong hung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nong hesuakna in hi thu a pha tak ngaisun in, na vawt tu sia khensat in. Hi sia in ih topa le a innkuanpuite atu lalna piangsak thei tu hi. Ama sia mawmaw thinpui khat hi a, kuama nadon ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abigail in manlang takin anluum 200, savun tuithawl nii dim sapittui, tuu pum em nga, an puakkan kilogramme 17, sapitko bom zakhat, theiko moh luum 200 khawmtua in laa tungah suanh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a naseamte munah, “No, mai ah pai vun, kei, nung pan kong zui tu hi,” ci hi. Ahihang a pasal munah bangma son ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama a laa tung to in a pai le muallimvei khat ah thakhatin David le a mite hong pai taw kikealsik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David in, “Banghangin hisia pa ii neisate hilai duisung ah hun sasak ka na khi ziam? Ama ii neisa khat zongh kinguksak ngeingawl hi, tu in ka huna sa teng hi bangin hong thukkikna ahi ve!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zingsang khuavak ma in tua pasalte khat zongh kikhe ngawlin ka that siat buale Pathian in keima hong vaat tahen!” ci in ngaisun hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abigail in David a mu ciang manlang takin a laa tung pan tuakin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />David peang kung lei ah kisepin, “Topa awng, nong hesuakna in hong ngai ta'n! Keima a mawpu hi tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangma kimanna a nei ngawl Nabal sia awlmaw heak in! Ama sia a min ii khiakna — ‘A Mawmaw’ ci sia ma hi takpi hi! Na naseamte hong thet lai in tua munah keima om ngawl luilam khi hi, topa awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Phulam in na ngalte na thalup ngawl natu pan hong keamcing sia Topa hi. Tuaciang tu in a nungta Topa taw ka kiciamna pan, na ngalte le nang hong susia nuamte theampo sia Nabal bangin daan thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nong hesuakna in topa awng, kong paipui hi letsong sia hong saang ta'n, na mite pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka khialna a om le nong hesuakna in hong maisak ta'n. Topa in nangma le na suan na paalte zongh kumpi hong suaksak tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama ii ngalte nangma in na simsak hi; tuaciang na nuntak sung tawntung na tatkha ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaciang mihing khat po in nang hong simin that tu in hong hanciam le Topa na Pathian in sumngum manphate a kep bangin nang hong keamcing tu hi. Na ngalte ahile, mihing khat ii saili taw suangtang a kaa bangin ama in lawnthal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciangin Topa in nang atu hong kamciamsa napha theampo hong tungsak a, Israel kumpipa hong suasak ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />topa awng a thu om ngawl bulin ngual na thalupna ahibuale nangma thu in, phu na lamnate hu in kisii na, thin nop ngawlna na nei buatu hi. Tuaciang Topa in thupha hong piak zawkciangin, topa, kei hong mangil heak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David in ama munah, “Tuni in kei taw kisi tu a nang hong puak Israel te ii Pathian Topa pok tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na khua ngaisut thiamna, tuaciang mihing thalupna khialna lian ka vawt tu le keima thu in phu ka lam natu pan tuni nong kep natu in, na sep na vawt teng hu in Pathian ka pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in nang kong suksiat ngawl natu in kei hong keam zo hi. Ahihang a nungta Israel te ii Pathian taw kiciam in kong sonna pan, keima taw kisi tu in a manlang tatak hong pai buathong le te tu zingsang in, Nabal ii mite theampo thi siat tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David in ama kungah hong puak letsong teng saang a, “Va cia kik ta'n a, thinngim heak in. Na dei bangin vawt tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Abigail sia kumpipa khat atu a kilawm poai khat, a inn ah a khaam Nabal kungah ciakik hi. Zu khamin maimua nuamin om a, tua ahikom a zingsang ciang mateng ama ii munah bangma son ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A zukham hong thai ciang ama in thu theampo son hi. Thakhatin ama sia pumzaw natna hong nga a, a tung thei nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ni sawm khawng zawkciang Topa in Nabal sia vaatin thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nabal ii thina David in a zaak ciang, “ Topa pok vun! Nabal tungah ama in kei hong nunau hu in phu hong lamsak a, kei a naseampa ii ka khial ngawl natu hong keamcing hi. Topa in Nabal sia a khansiat hu in daan tat hi,” ci hi. Tua zawkciang David in kiteen natu mo dokna Abigail tungah thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A naseamte Carmel ah pai in, “David in a zi tu, nang hong pui tu in ko hong sawl hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Abigail lei ah kun sukin, hi bangin ci hi, “Keima a naseamnu hi a, a naseamte ii peang a silsak tu naseam ka hi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama manlang tak tho in a laa tungah to hi. A lalang numei nga teng taw David ii naseamte taw ton in, a zi suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />David in Jezreel mi Ahinoam teenpui zo a, tu in Abigail zongh a zi hong suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua lanin Saul in David ii zi ahi a tanu Michal sia Gallim khua Laish ii tapa Palti a piaksak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ziph khua panin pasal pawlkhat Saul omna Gibeah ah hong pai in David sia Hachilah Mual Judah ngampa ii mong ah buu hi ci in son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thakhat ma in Saul in Israel ngalkap phabel 3,000 tonpui in Ziph duisung ah David zong tu in pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuaciang Hachilah Mualtung lampi hui ah ngiaphual saat uh hi. David sia duisung ah om lai a, ama zong tu in Saul hong pai ci in a heak ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ngalvilte a paisak le, Saul sia tua munah na om takpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama thakhatin pai a, Saul le Ner ii tapa Abner, Saul ii ngalkap hon ukpipa lupna mun tatak ma mu hi. Saul sia ngiaphual sung sangah lum a, a mite sia ama ii kiim ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang David in Hit mi Ahimelech le Joab ii suapuipa Abishai (A nu uh sia Zeruiah hi), te munah, “No nii akua zaw in Saul ii ngiaphual ah hong zui tu nu ziam?” a ci ciang, Abishai in, “Keima hong zui tong,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zanin, David le Abishai te Saul ii ngiaphual sung sangah tum in, Saul sia ngiaphual laizang ah mutchip in a om mu a, a luthung ah a tei phut hi. Abner le ngalkapte a kiim ah mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abishai in David munah, “Pathian in na ngalpa na khut sungah tu zanin hong pia hi. Tu in ama ii tei taw ma in keima in ama lei taw cip in hong sunletsak ta'n, khatvei sut taw kiman tu hi — niivei ka sut kul ngawl tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang David in, “Ama susia ngawl het tu ni hi! Topa in ama ii tealsa kumpipa a susia peuma daan pia nanak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in a pau zomto lai in, “Thi kum tungin, thi ngei a thi tu ahizong, ngalphual ah thi tu ahizong, Topa ama mama in Saul sia thatlum tu ci in a nungta Topa tungtawnin he khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in ama ii koisa kumpipa sia ka suksiat tu oai ngawl hi! A tei le a tuithawl la in, pai ka tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabangin David in Saul ii tei le a tuithawl Saul ii luthung pan la a, ama le Abishai in nusia uh hi. Kuama a mu om ngawl, bang thu piang ci in a he zongh om ngawlin, a khanglo beak zongh a om bua uh hi — amate a vekpi in mutchip dipdeap uh hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in a mutciiksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in a kuam langkhat kaantan in mualdawn, a khuala khopna mun khat panin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul ii ngalkapte le Abner ama in oksan a, “Abner awng! Nong za thei ziam?” ci hi. Abner in, “Kumpipa phawng tu in a au sia akua ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in “Abner, nang sia Israel ngam ah mi lianbel hi ka na ngawl ni ziam? Banghangin na topa kumpipa hung zo ngawl ni ziam? Tu ma hiat in na topa thatlum tu in mihing khat ngiaphual sungah hong tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na vaipuak lel ni hi, Abner awng! A nungta Topa taw kiciamin kong cina pan, no theampo a thi tu kilawm nu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa ii kumpipa a suasak na topa uh hung ngawl nu hi. En in! Kumpipa ii tei koisungah om ziam? A lu hui a tuithawl sia koisung om ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in David ii aw tel a, “David ka tapa awng, nangma ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Hi khi hi, kumpipa awng,” ci in David in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in, “Topa awng, kei na naseampa banghangin hong delkot lai ni ziam? Bang vawt na khi ziam? Bang khialna lian vawt khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa awng, kong son tu sia na ngai in. Kei nong langpan natu hong vawt pa sia Topa ahile ama tung a biakpiakna khat vawt leang a thin khealsak tu hi; ahihang mihingte ii vawt ahile Topa haamsiatna amate tungah tung tahen. Banghang ziam cile Topa ii ngam le lei panin ngamdang pathiante bek ka biak thei natu ngam ah kei hong kinotkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa taw a kikhuala ngamdang leitang tungah thalup hong thuaksak heak in. Banghangin Israel ii kumpipa in kei uili khat bang ahi sia that tu in hong pai ziam? Ngam sungah vacimte khat vai bangin ama in banghang hong vai zui hi tu ziam?” ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in, “Keima khial zo khi hi. Hong heak kik ta'n, David ka tapa awng. Bangma hong law kik ngawl tu khi hi, banghang ziam cile tu zanin ka nuntakna hong khoaikhe ni hi. Kei sia mawmaw khi hi! A lipkhaphuai mama na khat vawt zo thong khi hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in, “Kumpipa awng, hi sungah na tei om hi. Na mihingte khat hong paisak in hong lasak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in a thumaante le a thutangte tel pia hi. Tuni in ama in nang, keima khut sungah hong pia hi, ahihang Topa ii kumpipa in hong koisa nang sia kong susia bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na nuntakna tuni in kong khoaikhet bangma in, Topa in kei tungah hong vawt in ngim ngana theampo pan hong suaktasak tahen!” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul in David munah, “Pathian in thupha hong pia tahen, ka tapa awng! Na sep na vawt theampo zo tu ni hi!” ci hi. Tuabangin David, ama ii pai natu ah pai a, Saul sia inn ah ciakik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in ama le ama hi bangin kici hi, “Ni khat teteei ciang Saul in kei hong thatlum tu hi. Kei ngamtat natu a phabel sia Philistia ah tai in ka suatak tu ahi hi. Tuasia ciang Saul in kei Israel ngam sungah hong zon sia kheal tu a, ka ngammuang tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom David le a mite 600 sia thakhat ma in Gath kumpipa Maoch ii tapa Achish kung zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David le a mite sia a innkuanpuite taw Gath ah peam uh hi. David taw a kop a zite nii sia Jezreel pan Ahinoam le Carmel pan Nabal ii zi meingongnu Abigail ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul in David Gath ah a tai a zaak ciang David a zon tawntung kheal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in Achish munah, “Nang ka lawm na hile ka teen natu khuano khat hong ngasak ta'n. Topa awng khuapi sungah nang taw ka teenkhop tu sia kisam ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Achish in Ziklag khua pia a, tua hu in Ziklag sia Judah kumpite neisa hi top hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in Philistia ah tha sawm le tha luk teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hun sung tengin David le a mite in tua Geshur, Girzi, le Amalek ngamkhente sungah khuangeipi a teang sa mite sim uh hi. Ama in amate ii ngam sia Shur dong, Egypt paina lamdung theampo simsuk hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a pasalte le a nupite that in, a tuu, a khui, a laa le a kalaoh te le puan ngawngawn laaksak uh hi. Tua zawkciang Achish kung veu ah cia kik hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua pa in, “Tutung koisungah ngal sim ni ziam?” ci in dongh bul a, tuaciang David in, Judah thangsang ngam, ahibuale Jerahmeel bee le phungte ngam, ahibuale zong Ken te ii teenna ngamte ka sim hi ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in, ama le a mite ii ngamtatna sa teng kuama ii Gath ah cia in a son thei ngawl natu in, pasal le numei theampo thatlum siat hi. Hisia in Philistia ah a teen sung tawntung David ngamtatna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang Achish in David muang a, ama le ama hi bang kici hi, “Ama sia a mipui Israel te in ensan mama ahiciang a nuntak tawntung keima na hong sepsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawk tawmvei ciangin Philistine te in Israel sim tu in a ngalkapte uh khawmtua hi, tuaciang Achish in David munah, “Nang le na mite in kei sang pan ngal sim tu ci sia na tel sa hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in, “Hi mama hi. Kei na naseampa khi hi, tuaciang bang ciang vawt thei khi ziam ci sia nangma mama in nong mu tu hi,” ci in zo hi. Achish in, “Pha hi! A tawntungin keima hong cing pa kong suaksak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu in Samuel thi zo a, Israel theampo ama ii a nusiat hangin khuangai in, ama ii khua Ramah ah phum uh hi. Saul in aisaan theite le thaa sam theite theampo zawthawk thu taw Israel panin hawlkhia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistine ngalkapte kikhawmtua a, Shunem khua hui ah ngiaphual saat uh hi; Saul in Israel te khawmtua in Gilboa Mual ah ngiaphual saat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul in Philistine ngalkapte a mu ciang lau mama hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua ahikom ama in Topa munah bang law tu khi ziam ci in dongh hi. Ahihang Topa in mang sung pan ahizong, Urim le Thummim tung pan ahizong, kamsaangte tung pan ahizong, a zo mama bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Saul in a uliante thupia a, “Thaa sam thei nupi khat va zong tavun, keima pai in thu dongh tu khi hi,” ci hi. Amate in, “Endor ah khat om hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul kimealseal a, puan dang silh in, khuazin zawkciang a mite nii taw tua nupi nu taw kisi tu in pai hi. Ama in, “Thaate tungah dongh in a, bang thu piang tu ziam hong son ta'n. A min kong law pasal khat ii thaa sam in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nupi nu in zo a, “Kumpipa Saul ngamtatna teng na heak siat sa hi a, Israel ngamsung panin aisaan theite le thaa sam theite theampo hawlkeak hi. Tua ahiciang, banghangin kei thaang hong sia in hong kithatlumsak tu ni ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Saul in kiciamna thiangtho khat vawt hi. Ama in, “A nungta Topa min taw kamciam hong pia khi hi, hisia na sep hu in daan hong kipia ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Akua thaa hong samsak tu khi ziam?” nupi nu in ci hi. Ama in, “Samuel” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua nu in Samuel a mu ciang ciik au in Saul munah, “Banghang hong theam ni ziam? Nang Saul kumpipa ni hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Lau heak in! Bang na mu ziam?” Kumpipa in ci hi. Nupi nu in, “Thaa khat sia lei panin hong pai to ka mu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, “Tuasia bang taw kibang ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Pasal huai khat hong pai to hi. Ama in puantual tungsilh silh hi,” ci in nupi nu in zo hi. Tuasia ciang Saul in Samuel hi ci in he a, ama a zatakna in lei ah bok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel in Saul munah, “Banghangin kei hong nawngkaisak ni ziam? Banghangin hong pai kiksak ni ziam?” ci hi. Saul in, “Ngimna lianpi sungah om khi hi! Philistine te sia kei ngalin hong pang hi, tuaciang Pathian in kei hong nusia hi. Ama in kamsaangte tungtawn ahizong, mang tungtawn ahizong ka thudok hong zo nawn ngawl hi. Tua ahikom bang vawt tu khi ziam nong son natu nang hong sam khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samuel in, “ Topa in nang hong nusia zo a, na ngal a sua zawk nungsang, banghangin kei hong sam ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah hong sonsa bangma in ama in nang tungah hong seam zo hi: ama in kumpi ngam sia na khut sung pan la keakin David hong piaksak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma in Topa thupiak ni ngawlin, Amalek te le a neisa theampo a vaikhua in susia cip ngawl ni hi. Tua hu in Topa in hisia tu in nang tungah hong vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in nang le Israel sia Philistine te khut sungah hong aap tu hi. Zing ciangin nang le na tapate in kei kung nong theng tu uh a, Topa in Israel ngalkaphonpi zongh Philistine te aap tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samuel ii pau teng hu in thakhat ma in Saul puksuk a, lau leilam in lei ah kithuang hi. Ama sia ni bup le zan tawntung bangma neak nei ngawl ahikom in a tha zawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nupinu in ama kungah hong pai in lau ngawpin om a mu ciang, “Topa awng, nong hesuakna in ka luang aitaa in, nong sawl teng hong vawtsak khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu in nong hesuakna in kong nget bangin hong ngamta ta'n. Nang atu an tawm kong vawtsak tu hi. Na khualhaw thei khom natu na thahat natu in an na neak kul tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul in bangma ne ngawl tu khi hi ci in nial hi. Ahihang a uliante zongh in ama an ne in sawl uh hi. A khakbel ciang ama in zawp in lei pan tho to a, lupna tungah hong to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nupinu in a thau tu in a vaak top khuino sia ngo hi. Tuaciang ama in anvui pawlkhat la a, tol saw ngawl anluum in hong em hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in Saul le a uliante mai ah a an lui a, amate in ne uh hi. Amate tua zan ma in ding kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistine te in a ngalkap theampo Aphek ah hong paipui uh hi, tua laitakin Israel te sia Jezreel Kuam sungah a om cik ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistine kumpi nga teng in amate mi tek a za pawl, a tul pawl taw kuan uh hi; David le a mite, Achish kumpipa taw a nungsang pan kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philistine ngalkap maangte in amate mu in, “Hi Hebrew te, hi sungah bang hong hi ziam?” ci uh hi. Achish in, “Hi sia David hi, Israel kumpipa Saul ii ulian khat hi. Tu in ama sia kei taw khuangeipi ma omkhawm zo khu hi. Ama kei kung hong zot pan kipan ka mawsak natu a ngamtatna bangma mu ngawl khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang Philistine ngalkap maangte in Achish tungah thin uuk in, ama munah, “Tuasia pa na piaksa khua ah puak kik in. Ngal kidona phual ah ei taw kuansak heak in; ngal kido sungin ama in ei hong langpan kik thei tha tu hi. A topa ii maipha a nga kik natu in ih mite thina sangin ama atu a phazaw dang bang om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tatakin ci leang, ama sia David hi a, numeite laamin lasa a, ‘Saul in a tul a tul in that a, David in a tulsawm, a tulsawm in that hi,’ a ci sia pa hi ngawl ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Achish in David sam a, “Israel ii a nungta Pathian taw kiciam hi tong, nang sia kei tungah hong thumaan ni hi; hi kidona sungah kei taw kikop in ngal hong simsak leng lungkim tu khi hi. Kei kung nong zot ni pan kipan nang tungah mawna kong sot tu bangma om ngawl hi. Ahihang kumpi dangte in hong thukimpui ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom inn ah thinnuam takin cia kik ta'n a, amate lungkim ngawl tu bangma vawt heak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in, “Bang ka sep khial om ziam, topa awng. Na ci bangin nang kung kong zot a kipan na na ka sepna sungah sep khial vawt khial nei ngawl ka hile, nang ka topa le ka kumpipa taw kuankhawm in na ngalte hong dosak ngawl tu khi ziam,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Achish in, “Na ci teng thukim khi hi, nang sia Pathian vantung mi khat za in hong thumaan hi ci in kong ngaisun hi. Ahihang kumpi dangte in nang sia ngal sungah ko taw kuan khawm thei ngawl tu hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom David awng, Saul nusia in, kei kungah hong pai note theampo sia zing ciang, thopal in khuavak po ciang nong nusiat uh kul tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabangin David le a mite, a zing ciang zing tuungin Philistia zuan kik a, Philistine te sia Jezreel ah paitan uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni nii zawkciang David le a mite Ziklag theng kik uh hi. Amalek te in Judah thangsang sim zo a, Ziklag sim uh hi. Amate in a khua haltham a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />numei teng man hi; kuama that ngawl ahihang a nusiat uh ciang a kuama theampo paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David le a mite hong thet uh ciang, a khua kihal tham sa in mu a, a zite, a tapate, a tanute kipaipui siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David le a mite kakap in, a tha bo vanek dong tawp ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David zite nii, Ahinoam le Abigail ngawngawn laaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David sia tu in a thinngim mama hi, banghang ziam cile a mite a vekpi in a tate a bosua hu in a thin uh na mama a, amate in David suang taw denlup tu in tawng hi; ahihang Topa a Pathian in ama thinletna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in Ahimelech ii tapa thiampi Abiathar munah, “Ephod hong paipui tavun,” ci a, Abiathar in ama kungah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Topa tungah, “Tua hong simthamte ka del tu ziam? Amate ka man zo tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ama in, “Del in; amate man zo lai tu ni hi, tuaciang a matte zongh suatak tu ni hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom David le ama mi 600 teng hong kipan a, Besor Lui a thet uh ciangin amate pawlkhat tua munah taam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in mihing 400 taw paisuak a; a dang 200 teng lui kaan tu in toi lei ahikom nungah taam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David taw a kithua mite in Egypt te patangno khat ngam sungah mu in, David kungah paipui uh hi. Amate in an le tui tawm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />theinga ngawm tawm le sapit ko ngawm bom nii pia uh hi. An a neak zawkciang a tha hong hat kik hi; ama in an ahizong tui ahizong a neak ngawl zawk ni thum hi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in, “Na topa akua hi a, koisung pan hong pai ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ama in, “Kei Egypt te khat hi a, Amalek te khat ii sila ka hi hi. Ka topa in tu nung ni thum lai in ka ciina ahikom hong nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah ngam thangsang ah a om Chereth te ngam le Caleb bee le phung te ii ngam teng simtham in, Ziklag sia ka hal tum uh hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in, “Tua hong simthamte kungah nong paipui tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ama in, “Kei nong thalup ngawl natu le ka topa kungah nong aap ngawl natu Pathian min taw kamciam hong pia po lete, hong paipui tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in David sia amate kungah paipui hi. Tua a simthamte sia Philistia le Judah ngam pan a laak uh vanh tam mama te ai in poai khaam uh a, an ne, zu dawn in, mun theampo ah kithethaang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A khuavak ni zing tuungin David in sim a, nitak dong kido uh hi. Kalaoh tung to in a tai khangno 400 simngawl kuama a suakta om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David in Amalek te ii laak sa na theampo le a mat teng ama zite nii dongin suatak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />bangma a sumsi om ngawl hi. David in a mite ii tapate, tanute le Amalek te ii laak sa na theampo nga kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in tuu hon le khui hon te zongh nga kik a; a mite in amate mai ah nganno theampo hawl a, tuaciang, “Hi teng David ii neisa hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David in Besor Lui ah tha zawm leih in nungsang ah a taam 200 te kungah pai kik hi. Amate sia David le a mite muak tu in hong pai a, tuaciang David in pha takin amate nukset hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang mihing mannung ngawl thusel pawlkhat in, “Amate ei taw hong kuan khawm ngawl ahiciang, ih vanh ngate hawm ngawl tu hi. Amate in a zite le a tate la in cia thei tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang David in, “Ka suapuite awng, Topa ii hong piak vanhte tungtaang ah tuabangin ngamta thei ngawl tu nu hi! Ama in ei hong keamcing a, hong simthamte tungah zawna hong ngasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />No ii ci bang sia kuama in hong thukim pui thei ngawl tu hi! Ih vekpi a kibangin ih hawm kul tu hi: a kuama po nungsang ah vanhcing te zongh, ngalphual ah a kuante nga za ma nga tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />David in hi thuthun vawt a, tuate Israel ngam ah tua hun pan kipan kizui tan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David in Ziklag ah hong heak kik ciangin, vanh a laakte pawlkhat sia a lawmte ahi Judah lampuite munah, “Hi sungah Topa ii ngalte vanh ka laaksak uh sung pan no atu letsong hi,” cisak in puak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in tua letsong sia Bethel khua mite, Judah thangsang ngam a om Ramah khua mite, tuaciang Jattir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aroer, Siphmoth, Eshtemoa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />le Racal khua mite; Jerahmeel bee le phung, Ken mite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuaciang Hormah, Borashan le Athach,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />le Hebron khua mite teng tungah puak hi. Ama in ama le a mite vaa kotna mun theampo ah tua letsong puak siat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilboa Mual ngal kidona ah Philistine te in Israel te do uh hi. Israel te tam mama tua munah thi in, a taang laiteng, Kumpipa Saul le a tapate zongh tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang Philistine te in amate pha in Saul ii tapate thum, Jonathan, Abinadab le Malchishua te that uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul ii kiim ah nasia tak ngal kidona om a, Saul ama mama ngalte thaltangte in kha in, nasia liam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a ngalhiam pua tangvalpa munah, “Pathian sel Philistine te ii selno a hong thalup ngawl natu in, na namsau dokin hong that ta'n,” ci hi. Ahihang tangvalpa in tuabang a ngamtat tu lau mama hi. Tua ahikom Saul in ama namsau ma la in tua dawnah ama le ama kisep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangvalpa in Saul thi zo ci in a mu ciang, ama zongh ama ii namsau dawn ma ah kisepin Saul taw thi khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabangin Saul, a tapate thum le tangvalpa thi uh hi; Saul ii mite theampo tua ni in thi siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jezreel Kuam ii langkhat Jordan ngun nisuana sang a om Israel te in, Israel ngalkaphonpi taikeak zo a, Saul le a tapate kithat zo ci a zaak uh ciang amate a khua uh nusia in tai uh hi. Philistine te pai in tua khuate la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngal kido khuavak ni in Philistine te a thite vanh laaksak tu in hong pai uh ciang Saul le a tapate thum ii luang Gilboa Mualvum ah a kisial mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Saul ii ngawng tan in, a ngal dalna teng suut a, tuate taw kamtaite Philistia ngamsung tangciing amate ii milimte le a mite tungah a lungdamna thu taangko tu in paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in Saul ii ngalhiamte a Astarte numeipathian biakinn sungah koi in, a luang sia Beth Shan khuapi luphung tungah kilh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead ngam Jabesh mite in Saul tungah Philistine te ngamtatna a zaak uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />pasal hangbel teng hong kipanin Beth Shan ah zankhuateak a pai uh hi. Amate in Saul le a tapate ii luang teng luphung tung pan la in, Jabesh ah ciapui kik a, tua munah hal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang a ngu teng la a, khua sung makeang thingkung nuai ah phum in ni sali sung an tang uh hi.
  </para>
</usx>
